  \ submitting this, I’ll work on implementing a local optimizer to maximize the sum of radii.**Finalizing code and parameters**\n\nI want to keep my token usage minimal, so I’m prioritizing efficiency in the content. I’ve decided to use an epsilon margin of 1e-8 to ensure safety in calculations. This should keep the distance minus the sum well within range, and I’ll be careful about using the right coordinate differences for accuracy. I’ll compute the distance safely and ensure r_hole remains positive. Let’s get the final code ready while keeping commentary brief for clarity."
