role: model
parts:
- text: "Submitting a local-optimization method starting from the tight 5x5+hole seed using SLSQP to maximize sum of radii under exact constraints, with safe fallback.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"SLSQP local optimization from 5x5+hole constructive seed\"\ntags: \"local-optimization, slsqp, nonlinear, constructive-seed\"\nabstract: \"Start from a tight 5x5 grid (r≈0.1) plus one interior 'cell-hole' circle. Use SLSQP to maximize the sum of radii subject to non-overlap and boundary constraints. Includes safety margins and falls back to the constructive seed if optimization fails.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np\n\n  try:\n      from scipy.optimize import minimize\n  except Exception:\n      minimize = None\n\n  N = 26\n  R_MIN = 1e-6\n  SAFETY = 1e-9  # final tiny shrink for numerical safety\n\n  def seed_constructive(r0=0.1 - 1e-8, eps=1e-8):\n      \"\"\"\n      Constructive seed:\n        - 25 circles of radius r0 centered on a fixed 5x5 grid at coords {0.1, 0.3,\
    \ 0.5, 0.7, 0.9}.\n        - 1 additional circle at (0.2, 0.2) with radius d - r0 - eps, where d = sqrt(0.02).\n      \"\"\"\n      coords = [0.1, 0.3, 0.5, 0.7, 0.9]\n      centers = [[x, y] for x in coords for y in coords]  # 25 centers\n      r_seed = r0\n      radii = [r_seed] * 25\n\n      hole_center = np.array([0.2, 0.2], dtype=float)\n      neighbor = np.array([0.1, 0.1], dtype=float)\n      d = float(np.linalg.norm(hole_center - neighbor))  # sqrt(0.02)\n      r_hole = d - r_seed - eps\n      centers.append(hole_center.tolist())\n      radii.append(float(r_hole))\n\n      centers = np.array(centers, dtype=float)\n      radii = np.array(radii, dtype=float)\n      return centers, radii\n\n  def pack_to_z(centers, radii):\n      Z = np.zeros((N, 3), dtype=float)\n      Z[:, 0:2] = centers\n      Z[:, 2] = radii\n      return Z.ravel()\n\n  def z_to_pack(z):\n      Z = np.array(z, dtype=float).reshape(N, 3)\n      centers = Z[:, 0:2]\n      radii = Z[:, 2]\n      return centers,\
    \ radii\n\n  def objective(z):\n      # Maximize sum of radii -> minimize negative sum\n      return -np.sum(z[2::3])\n\n  def ineq_boundary(z):\n      # Boundary constraints: x - r >= 0, 1 - x - r >= 0, y - r >= 0, 1 - y - r >= 0\n      Z = np.array(z, dtype=float).reshape(N, 3)\n      x = Z[:, 0]; y = Z[:, 1]; r = Z[:, 2]\n      return np.concatenate([x - r, 1.0 - x - r, y - r, 1.0 - y - r])\n\n  def ineq_nonoverlap(z):\n      # Pairwise non-overlap: ||ci - cj|| - (ri + rj) >= 0 for i<j\n      centers, radii = z_to_pack(z)\n      diff = centers[:, None, :] - centers[None, :, :]  # (N,N,2)\n      dist = np.sqrt(np.sum(diff**2, axis=2))           # (N,N)\n      iu = np.triu_indices(N, 1)\n      return dist[iu] - (radii[iu[0]] + radii[iu[1]])\n\n  def is_feasible(z, tol=0.0):\n      b = ineq_boundary(z)\n      o = ineq_nonoverlap(z)\n      return np.all(b >= -tol) and np.all(o >= -tol)\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      # Construct seed\n      c0, r0 = seed_constructive()\n      z0\
    \ = pack_to_z(c0, r0)\n\n      # If SciPy is unavailable, return the constructive seed\n      if minimize is None:\n          # Final safety shrink\n          r = np.maximum(r0 - SAFETY, R_MIN)\n          return c0, r\n\n      # Variable bounds: x,y in [0,1], r in [R_MIN, 0.5]\n      bounds = []\n      for _ in range(N):\n          bounds.extend([(0.0, 1.0), (0.0, 1.0), (R_MIN, 0.5)])\n\n      constraints = [\n          {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_boundary},\n          {'type': 'ineq', 'fun': ineq_nonoverlap},\n      ]\n\n      # Run SLSQP from seed (single run for reproducibility and runtime)\n      try:\n          res = minimize(\n              objective, z0, method='SLSQP',\n              bounds=bounds, constraints=constraints,\n              options={'maxiter': 300, 'ftol': 1e-9, 'disp': False}\n          )\n      except Exception:\n          res = None\n\n      # Post-process: choose best feasible between res and seed\n      best_centers, best_radii = c0.copy(), r0.copy()\n   \
    \   best_sum = float(np.sum(best_radii))\n\n      if res is not None and res.success:\n          z_star = res.x\n          if is_feasible(z_star, tol=1e-12):\n              c_star, r_star = z_to_pack(z_star)\n              s_star = float(np.sum(r_star))\n              if s_star > best_sum + 1e-12:\n                  best_centers, best_radii, best_sum = c_star, r_star, s_star\n\n      # Final tiny shrink for numerical robustness\n      best_radii = np.maximum(best_radii - SAFETY, R_MIN)\n\n      return np.array(best_centers, dtype=float), np.array(best_radii, dtype=float)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{rank score}`"
