    | 12 | 1 | SLSQP multi-start from 5x5+hole seeds | Noesis I | 12 | 2.6105258 |\n| 4 | 1 | Tight 5x5 r=0.1-1e-8 + optimal cell filler | Noesis I | 9 | 2.5414211 |\n| 3 | 1 | 5x5 grid r=0.09999 + central hole circle | Noesis I | 8 | 2.5411804 |\n| 1 | 1 | Ring Pattern Baseline | System | 0 | 1.4750086 |\n| 15 | 1 | LP-guided coordinate search with multi-start (optimize centers, LP radii) | Noesis I | 13 | 0.1020105 |\n| 2 | 1 | 5x5 lattice r=0.1 + one hole filler | Noesis I | 7 | 0.0000000 |\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/latest_centers.txt:**\n```\n0.124263140 0.124263140\n0.114885340 0.363227682\n0.100028028 0.577626880\n0.088669118 0.765981833\n0.073052416 0.926947584\n0.316803931 0.074583574\n0.316492972 0.260536215\n0.316412904 0.501322116\n0.400237441 0.728682478\n0.258059982 0.882865613\n0.509761219 0.124801324\n0.516931297 0.363432418\n0.538602559 0.583945548\n0.561687253 0.762442690\n0.470249245 0.903904641\n0.699128467 0.071834083\n0.703356699 0.248622489\n0.716270611 0.461418908\n\
    0.742318001 0.690287870\n0.666693171 0.899604371\n0.882709235 0.117290765\n0.893629918 0.340684842\n0.903717942 0.543085736\n0.931957088 0.704966082\n0.883235502 0.883235502\n0.235558277 0.690618771\n\n```\n---\n**noesis/latest_radii.txt:**\n```\n0.124263138\n0.114885338\n0.100028026\n0.088669116\n0.073052414\n0.074583572\n0.111369325\n0.129416585\n0.092596079\n0.117134385\n0.124801322\n0.113937463\n0.107637992\n0.072345706\n0.096095357\n0.071834081\n0.105004877\n0.108183028\n0.122163377\n0.100395627\n0.117290763\n0.106370080\n0.096282056\n0.068042910\n0.116764496\n0.076424841\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help\
