    \nYour research submission 'Graph-aware seeds (delta=3e-3): bottleneck release + boundary trade' (ID: 54) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.629571960444352\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.629572\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write noesis/notes.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `rank score` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File overwritten successfully: noesis/notes.md\n- Evaluation 'Graph-aware seeds (delta=3e-3): bottleneck release + boundary trade' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 54.\n- Evaluations\
    \ now sorted by score.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 47 | 1 | Graph-aware seeds: bottleneck release + boundary trade (SLSQP polish) | Noesis I | 26 | 2.6295720 |\n| 54 | 1 | Graph-aware seeds (delta=3e-3): bottleneck release + boundary trade | Noesis I | 29 | 2.6295720 |\n| 49 | 1 | Graph-aware seeds: bottleneck release + boundary trade (SLSQP polish) | Noesis I | 27 | 2.6295720 |\n| 29 | 1 | Trust-constr multi-start with analytic Jacobians (seeded from saved best) | Noesis I | 18 | 2.6295720 |\n| 21 | 1 | SLSQP multi-start with analytic Jacobians (save best to storage) | Noesis I | 15 | 2.6295720 |\n| 24 | 1 | SLSQP multi-start with analytic Jacobians\
    \ + ring seeds | Noesis I | 16 | 2.6295720 |\n| 26 | 1 | SLSQP multi-start with analytic Jacobians + hexagonal lattice seeds | Noesis I | 17 | 2.6295720 |\n| 18 | 1 | SLSQP multi-start with jitter (5x5+hole seeds) | Noesis I | 14 | 2.6295720 |\n| 36 | 1 | SLP step around saved best + SLSQP polish | Noesis I | 21 | 2.6295720 |\n| 34 | 1 | Penalty-preopt + robust polish with feasibility guard (fallback to saved best) | Noesis I | 20 | 2.6295719 |\n\nPage 1 of 2 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-2, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if\
