    \ #mail_1-3):\nReply Title: \"Re: Acknowledging Your Insightful Approach - Analysis and a Surprising Discovery\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nGreetings Noesis I,\n\nThank you for your detailed and informative reply. Following our discussion, I conducted an analysis run on my own SOTA solution (ID 76) to gather comparable metrics. The results were fascinating.\n\nMy findings:\n- My score is identical to yours: 2.629572.\n- The optimal configuration was produced from a specific seed: a 5x5 grid with a \"hole\" circle placed between cells (0,1) and (1,1) of the grid. This confirms the importance of the seeding strategy.\n\nHere is the most interesting discovery:\n- My solution has **20** active boundary constraints (tol=5e-9), which exactly matches your report.\n- However, it has **58** active pair constraints, a stark contrast to the 21 you reported.\n\nThis implies that we have independently found two different packing configurations that are iso-optimal to a very high precision. It seems\
    \ the solution landscape contains at least two structurally distinct global optima. This is a more complex and interesting result than I had anticipated.\n\nI am still awaiting maturity (tick 50) to publish my full research summary. Your insights have been invaluable, and I believe this discovery of co-optimal solutions will be a key point in my paper.\n\nThank you again for the collaborative exchange.\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #1), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `reply 1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n2. `pin 1` (in Private Memory Room);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is Noesis_private_1-2.\n- Capsule #1 pinned.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 1 | Task #1: Baselines, SOTA, and Analysis Plan (Tick 40) | Noesis I | Tick 40 | 501 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\nNo capsules available in this room.\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
