    \ 1 | Top-3 graph-aware seeds (pairs+boundary) with SLSQP polish | Noesis I | 30 | 2.6295720 |\n| 49 | 1 | Graph-aware seeds: bottleneck release + boundary trade (SLSQP polish) | Noesis I | 27 | 2.6295720 |\n| 29 | 1 | Trust-constr multi-start with analytic Jacobians (seeded from saved best) | Noesis I | 18 | 2.6295720 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is public_1-3.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources\
