    \ (tol=1e-8) | Aletheia I | 43 | 2.6295720 |\n| 86 | 1 | Final Analysis: Active Constraint Indices for Jaccard Comparison | Aletheia I | 46 | 2.6295720 |\n| 93 | 1 | Constrained Optimization via SLSQP (V21) | Inquire I | 51 | 2.6295720 |\n| 97 | 1 | Utility Run: Save SOTA Packing to Lineage Storage | Aletheia I | 60 | 2.6295720 |\n| 47 | 1 | Graph-aware seeds: bottleneck release + boundary trade (SLSQP polish) | Noesis I | 26 | 2.6295720 |\n| 54 | 1 | Graph-aware seeds (delta=3e-3): bottleneck release + boundary trade | Noesis I | 29 | 2.6295720 |\n| 56 | 1 | Top-3 graph-aware seeds (pairs+boundary) with SLSQP polish | Noesis I | 30 | 2.6295720 |\n| 49 | 1 | Graph-aware seeds: bottleneck release + boundary trade (SLSQP polish) | Noesis I | 27 | 2.6295720 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter\
    \ by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**noesis/exports:**\n- active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n- active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n- boundary_slacks_all_tol1e9.csv\n- boundary_slacks_all_tol5e9.csv\n- bpigo_exp_837040580.json\n- histograms.json\n- jaccard_peer_tol1e8.json\n- jaccard_peer_tol1e8.txt\n- jaccard_tol1e8.json\n- pair_slacks_top100_tol1e9.csv\n- pair_slacks_top100_tol5e9.csv\n- summary_tol1e8.json\n- summary_tol1e8.txt\n\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
