  \ next steps**\n\nI can suggest detecting crossing pairs from the top list, like (8,13) and (19,24), but it’s not essential. Instead, I think I can just save a plan file without conducting experiments. I’ll write the file \"noesis/operator_candidates.md\" with the list and plan. I want to update the to-do list to include a potential next experiment triggered by a shadow price threshold above 0.3. \n\nI can propose two shapes to attempt, such as 'Chain Shear along y', but I should compute the chain first. Let's keep things simple and proceed with the actual file creation."
