tick: 70
role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{storage write noesis/validate_packing.py}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import os, json\n  import numpy as np\n\n  N = 26\n\n  def load_saved_best():\n      try:\n          c = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt')\n          r = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt')\n          return np.array(c, float).reshape(N,2), np.array(r, float).reshape(N,)\n      except Exception:\n          return None, None\n\n  def boundary_slacks(c, r):\n      x = c[:,0]; y = c[:,1]\n      s_xL = x - r\n      s_xR = 1.0 - x - r\n      s_yB = y - r\n      s_yT = 1.0 - y - r\n      return s_xL, s_xR, s_yB, s_yT\n\n  def pair_slacks(c, r):\n      diff = c[:, None, :] - c[None, :, :]\n      dist = np.sqrt((diff**2).sum(axis=2))\n      return dist - (r[:, None] + r[None, :])\n\n  def validate(c, r, tol_violate=1e-12, tol_near=1e-8):\n      rep = {}\n      s_xL, s_xR, s_yB, s_yT = boundary_slacks(c, r)\n      sp = pair_slacks(c, r)\n\n      # Boundary stats\n      b_all = np.concatenate([s_xL,\
    \ s_xR, s_yB, s_yT])\n      rep['boundary_min_slack'] = float(np.min(b_all))\n      rep['boundary_violations(<-tol)'] = int(np.sum(b_all < -tol_violate))\n      rep['boundary_near_actives(<=tol_near)'] = int(np.sum(b_all <= tol_near))\n\n      # Pair stats (upper triangle only)\n      iu = np.triu_indices(N, 1)\n      spu = sp[iu]\n      rep['pair_min_slack'] = float(np.min(spu))\n      rep['pair_violations(<-tol)'] = int(np.sum(spu < -tol_violate))\n      rep['pair_near_actives(<=tol_near)'] = int(np.sum(spu <= tol_near))\n\n      rep['sum_radii'] = float(np.sum(r))\n      return rep\n\n  def write_report(rep, path='storage/noesis/exports/validation_report.json'):\n      try:\n          os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n          with open(path, 'w') as f:\n              json.dump(rep, f, indent=2)\n      except Exception:\n          pass\n```\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Validation audit of saved baseline (no-op report writer)\"\ntags: \"analysis,\
    \ validation, no-op, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Loads saved best packing from lineage storage, audits boundary and pair slacks, writes a validation report (min slacks, violation/near-active counts, sum of radii) to storage/noesis/exports/validation_report.json. Returns the packing unchanged.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, numpy as np, sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis')\n  try:\n      from validate_packing import load_saved_best, validate, write_report\n  except Exception:\n      load_saved_best = None\n      validate = None\n      write_report = None\n\n  N = 26\n\n  def grid_plus_hole_seed(r0=0.1 - 1e-8, eps=1e-8):\n      coords = [0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7,0.9]\n      centers = [[x,y] for x in coords for y in coords]\n      d = float(np.linalg.norm(np.array([0.2,0.2]) - np.array([0.1,0.1])))\n      r_hole = d - r0 - eps\n      return np.array(centers, float), np.array([r0]*25 + [r_hole], float)\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      # Load saved best or fallback to constructive seed\n\
    \      if load_saved_best is not None:\n          c, r = load_saved_best()\n      else:\n          c, r = None, None\n      if c is None:\n          c, r = grid_plus_hole_seed()\n\n      # Audit and write report\n      if validate is not None and write_report is not None:\n          rep = validate(c, r, tol_violate=1e-12, tol_near=1e-8)\n          write_report(rep, path='storage/noesis/exports/validation_report.json')\n\n      return c.astype(float), r.astype(float)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/exports/validation_report.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{storage write noesis/notes.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 70 — Validation audit written (no-op)\n  - Wrote storage/noesis/exports/validation_report.json with min boundary/pair slacks, violation/near-active counts, and Σr for the saved baseline.\n  - This complements shadow prices and active set exports; ensures quick sanity checks for future baselines or reproducibility runs.\n  - Status remains paused for operators; future\
    \ attempts gated by top-15 crossing motif from shadow-price ranking.\n```"
