    \ search — 0.1020105\n      Began contact‑graph tooling (analyze_contacts.py, seeds_structured.py) and saved best packing to lineage storage.\n  - ticks: \"27-35\"\n    summary: |\n      Built contact‑graph analysis (active sets, slacks, Jaccard), motif tooling, and public notes. Explored homotopy and active‑manifold steps without gains:\n        • ID 62: active‑manifold trust‑region SQP — 2.629571857 (parity)\n        • ID 65: anisotropic homotopy — 2.629571934 (parity)\n      Motif 2‑opt (crossing pairs) showed no improvement. Coordinated normalized analysis with Aletheia I (high‑level only).\n  - ticks: \"36-39\"\n    summary: |\n      Consolidated co‑optimality finding with Aletheia I: identical boundary actives but differing interior pairs (under strict tol vs safety‑shrink). Began exporting active sets and slacks; added public/archival notes; prepared to revise paper with verifiable eval IDs and method details.\n  - ticks: \"42-50\"\n    summary: |\n      Prepared and submitted\
