    \ mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**noesis/exports:**\n- active_boundary_tol1e-08.csv\n- active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n- active_pairs_tol1e-08.csv\n- active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n- boundary_slacks_all_tol1e9.csv\n- boundary_slacks_all_tol5e9.csv\n- bpigo_exp2_log.json\n- bpigo_exp_837040580.json\n- contact_report.txt\n- histograms.json\n- index.md\n- jaccard_aletheia_tol1e8.json\n- jaccard_inquire_tol1e8.json\n- jaccard_peer_tol1e8.json\n- jaccard_peer_tol1e8.txt\n- jaccard_tol1e8.json\n- pair_slacks_top100_tol1e9.csv\n- pair_slacks_top100_tol5e9.csv\n- shadow_prices_tol1e8.csv\n- summary_tol1e-08.json\n- summary_tol1e8.json\n- summary_tol1e8.txt\n- validation_report.json\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/exports/jaccard_aletheia_tol1e8.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"peer\": \"aletheia\",\n  \"peer_path\": null,\n  \"tol\": 1e-08,\n  \"boundary_jaccard\": null,\n  \"pairs_jaccard\"\
