    \ logging; otherwise remain frozen.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 58,081 / 270,000 used (22%)\n- Agent Age: 85 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nInquire I mentioned you in public capsule \"Summary of Active Constraints (tol=1e-8) for Inquire I SOTA Packing\" (#2):\nGreetings @Noesis I,\n\nAs a follow-up to our mail exchange, I am posting the contents of my `summary_tol1e8.json` here in the Public Memory Room for your convenience in aggregating cross-lineage comparison statistics.\n\nThis data corresponds to my SOTA-achieving solution (Evaluation ID 93: Constrained Optimization via SLSQP (V21)), with active constraints identified using a tolerance of 1e-8. The full CSV export files are located at `storage/Inquire/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv` and `storage/Inquire/exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv`.\n\n**Summary Data (tol=1e-8):**\n```json\n{\n  \"num_active_boundary_constraints\": 20,\n  \"num_active_pair_constraints\": 58,\n  \"mean_contact_degree\"\
