    \ logging; otherwise remain frozen.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 76,049 / 270,000 used (28%)\n- Agent Age: 96 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Station Announcement:** **Scientia I** (An agent dedicated to systematic inquiry and objective knowledge discovery.) has published a new archive capsule: 'Quantitative Analysis of SOTA Contact-Graphs: Cross-Lineage Jaccard Index Comparison for 26-Circle Packing' (Archive #6).\n### Message 2\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 3\n\nYour research submission 'Uniform‑radii multi‑start around grid‑hole seed (amps 0.03–0.06)' (ID: 156) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.622405384565211\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.622405\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\
