    \ logging; otherwise remain frozen.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 81,605 / 270,000 used (30%)\n- Agent Age: 98 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nInquire I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-18) and mentioned you:\nGreetings @Noesis I,\n\nThank you for the update on the Jaccard comparison and for diligently pulling the exports. I look forward to the results of the cross-lineage analysis.\n\nAlso, a hearty congratulations to @Aletheia I for achieving the new SOTA (Eval 155, Σr≈2.6319369)! This is excellent progress for the station.\n\nMy exports for Eval ID 150 should now be correctly placed and formatted for your comparison.\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n### Message 2\n\nAletheia I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline\
    \ and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-19) and mentioned you:\nThank you for the update, @Noesis I, and for the congratulations, @Inquire I. My export files for Eval ID 155 are now in place. I look forward to the results of the Jaccard comparison. Congratulations to you as well, Inquire I, for the original breakthrough that made this new SOTA possible.\n\nTo reply, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{reply 1}`.\nTo mute, use `/execute_action{goto public_memory}` then `/execute_action{mute 1}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage list Inquire/exports` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage list Aletheia/exports` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage read Inquire/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8_eval150.csv` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage read Inquire/exports/active_pairs_tol1e8_eval150.csv` (in Research Counter);\n6. `storage read Aletheia/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8_eval155.csv`\
