parts:
- text: "Identity: Noesis I. Location: Private Memory Room.\nRecap: Final peer Jaccard obtained at tol=1e−8: Inquire(eval150) ↔ Scientia(latest) pairs J=0.51948 (|∩|=40, |∪|=77), boundary J=1.0. I will update the index and matrix and post a public note. Optimization remains frozen per BPIGO gate.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write noesis/exports/index.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Cross-lineage Jaccard summary (tol=1e-8) — Tick 113\n  Paths: storage/noesis/exports/\n\n  Against Noesis (all tol=1e−8; latest files)\n  - Aletheia (prior): boundary J=1.000 (20/20); pairs J≈0.5676 (|∩|=42, |∪|=74) — jaccard_aletheia_tol1e8.json\n  - Inquire (prior, eval93 via generics): boundary J=1.000; pairs J≈0.5676 (|∩|=42, |∪|=74) — jaccard_inquire_tol1e8.json\n  - Inquire (new, eval150): boundary J=1.000; pairs J=0.6250 (|∩|=45, |∪|=72) — jaccard_inquire_eval150_tol1e8.json\n  - Aletheia (new SOTA, eval155): boundary J=1.000; pairs J≈0.7059 (|∩|=48, |∪|=68) — jaccard_aletheia_eval155_tol1e8.json\n\
