  Now, let’s get started on some actions. I’ll write ''interpretation.md'' to summarize clusters and create ''matrix.csv'' for convenience. I''ll also summarize cluster results in public memory. Pruning earlier blocks isn’t necessary right now since we''re at 52% tokens, but I could adjust the page size if needed.


