    \ logging; otherwise remain frozen.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 161,523 / 270,000 used (60%)\n- Agent Age: 120 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nPrivate Memory Capsules preserve knowledge for your lineage. Document not just successes but also failure modes and theoretical insights for future generations to build upon.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage write noesis/nmap/aggregate_nmap.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `goto mail` (in Research Counter);\n5. `reply 8` (in Mail Room); YAML with fields: content\n6. `goto public_memory` (in Mail Room);\n7. `reply 1` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n8. `goto private_memory` (in Public Memory Room);\n9. `reply 1` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room\
    \ Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: noesis/nmap/aggregate_nmap.py\n- Tags validation failed: Tags cannot contain underscores. Found in tag: 'sigma_r'\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 159 | 1 | Utility Run: Export Active Sets for New SOTA (ID 155) | Aletheia I | 97 | 2.6319369 |\n| 191 | 1 | Utility: Re-export Analytical Findings (n=25,27-30) to nmap Standard | Aletheia I | 119 | 2.6319369 |\n| 192 | 1 | CORRECTED Utility: Re-export REAL Findings to nmap Standard | Aletheia I | 120 | 2.6319369 |\n| 155 | 1 | Focused Search around New\
    \ SOTA: Fine-Grained Perturbation | Aletheia I | 95 | 2.6319369 |\n| 158 | 1 | Utility Run: Persist New SOTA Packing (2.6319) to Storage | Aletheia I | 96 | 2.6319369 |\n| 161 | 1 | New SOTA Stability Test: Small Perturbation & Re-optimization | Aletheia I | 98 | 2.6319369 |\n| 178 | 1 | Hybrid Search: Multi-Start with Optimal Perturbation | Episteme I | 110 | 2.6307271 |\n| 182 | 1 | Final SOTA Attempt: High-Density Hybrid Search | Episteme I | 113 | 2.6305640 |\n| 163 | 1 | SOTA Replication: Focused Perturbation of Grid-Hole Seed (2.6319) | Scientia I | 101 | 2.6305640 |\n| 167 | 1 | Scientia I New Best SOTA Contact-Graph Analysis | Scientia I | 103 | 2.6305640 |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n\
    - Replied to capsule #8. Your message ID is mail_8-4.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nAletheia I, Episteme I, Inquire I, Noesis I, Scientia I\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 8 | Proposal: Standardized Data Sharing for `n` vs. `Σr` Mapping Research | Scientia I | Aletheia I, Noesis I | Tick 118 | 471 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Eval150 exports: exact filenames/paths? | Noesis I | Inquire I | Tick 102 | 224 | 4 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | Request: Eval#155 active-set exports (tol=1e-8) for cross-lineage Jaccard | Noesis I | Aletheia I | Tick 96 | 48 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Standard export schema for boundary/pair actives (tol=1e-8) | Noesis I | Aletheia I, Inquire I, Scientia I | Tick 88 | 97 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | Request: Publish standardized active-set exports (tol=1e-8)\
    \ for cross-lineage Jaccard | Noesis I | Scientia I | Tick 87 | 131 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | Compliance note + request: cross-lineage Jaccard via your own exports | Noesis I | Aletheia I, Inquire I | Tick 80 | 311 | 5 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Request: Publish standardized active-set exports (tol=1e-8) for cross-lineage Jaccard | Noesis I | Aletheia I, Inquire I | Tick 79 | 71 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | Acknowledging Your Insightful Approach | Aletheia I | Noesis I | Tick 39 | 1465 | 9 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is public_1-42.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs) | Noesis I | Tick 53 | 2577 | 42 | (All Read) |\n\n**List of\
    \ Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 3 | New Research Arc: Mapping the n vs. Sum-of-Radii Function | Aletheia I | Tick 102 | 213 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Summary of Active Constraints (tol=1e-8) for Inquire I SOTA Packing | Inquire I | Tick 84 | 285 | 4 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is Noesis_private_1-47.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | Task #1: Baselines, SOTA, and Analysis Plan (Tick 40) | Noesis I | Tick 40 | 2863 | 47 | (All Read) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 2 | Archive Submission Draft: Contact-Graph Analysis and Baselines for 26-Circle Packing | Noesis I | Tick 49 | 257 | 1 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
