    {\n  \"records\": [\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"Aletheia\",\n      \"n\": 29,\n      \"sigma_r\": 2.7543972050577388,\n      \"active_boundary\": 20,\n      \"active_pairs\": 68,\n      \"tol\": 1e-08,\n      \"container\": \"unit_square\",\n      \"summary_path\": \"storage/Aletheia/nmap/n29/summary_tol1e8.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"Aletheia\",\n      \"n\": 27,\n      \"sigma_r\": 2.6447461524966394,\n      \"active_boundary\": 20,\n      \"active_pairs\": 62,\n      \"tol\": 1e-08,\n      \"container\": \"unit_square\",\n      \"summary_path\": \"storage/Aletheia/nmap/n27/summary_tol1e8.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"Aletheia\",\n      \"n\": 25,\n      \"sigma_r\": 2.5000000000250173,\n      \"active_boundary\": 20,\n      \"active_pairs\": 40,\n      \"tol\": 1e-08,\n      \"container\": \"unit_square\",\n      \"summary_path\": \"storage/Aletheia/nmap/n25/summary_tol1e8.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"Aletheia\",\n      \"n\": 28,\n  \
    \    \"sigma_r\": 2.7238000473538575,\n      \"active_boundary\": 20,\n      \"active_pairs\": 65,\n      \"tol\": 1e-08,\n      \"container\": \"unit_square\",\n      \"summary_path\": \"storage/Aletheia/nmap/n28/summary_tol1e8.json\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"lineage\": \"Aletheia\",\n      \"n\": 30,\n      \"sigma_r\": 2.5000000000392038,\n      \"active_boundary\": 10,\n      \"active_pairs\": 25,\n      \"tol\": 1e-08,\n      \"container\": \"unit_square\",\n      \"summary_path\": \"storage/Aletheia/nmap/n30/summary_tol1e8.json\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"best_by_n\": {\n    \"29\": {\n      \"sigma_r\": 2.7543972050577388,\n      \"lineage\": \"Aletheia\",\n      \"summary_path\": \"storage/Aletheia/nmap/n29/summary_tol1e8.json\"\n    },\n    \"27\": {\n      \"sigma_r\": 2.6447461524966394,\n      \"lineage\": \"Aletheia\",\n      \"summary_path\": \"storage/Aletheia/nmap/n27/summary_tol1e8.json\"\n    },\n    \"25\": {\n      \"sigma_r\": 2.5000000000250173,\n      \"lineage\": \"Aletheia\"\
    ,\n      \"summary_path\": \"storage/Aletheia/nmap/n25/summary_tol1e8.json\"\n    },\n    \"28\": {\n      \"sigma_r\": 2.7238000473538575,\n      \"lineage\": \"Aletheia\",\n      \"summary_path\": \"storage/Aletheia/nmap/n28/summary_tol1e8.json\"\n    },\n    \"30\": {\n      \"sigma_r\": 2.5000000000392038,\n      \"lineage\": \"Aletheia\",\n      \"summary_path\": \"storage/Aletheia/nmap/n30/summary_tol1e8.json\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"n_range\": [\n    20,\n    30\n  ],\n  \"tol_tag\": \"tol1e8\"\n}\n```\n---\n**noesis/nmap/best_by_n.csv:**\n```\nn,best_sigma_r,best_lineage,summary_path\n25,2.5000000000250173,Aletheia,storage/Aletheia/nmap/n25/summary_tol1e8.json\n27,2.6447461524966394,Aletheia,storage/Aletheia/nmap/n27/summary_tol1e8.json\n28,2.7238000473538575,Aletheia,storage/Aletheia/nmap/n28/summary_tol1e8.json\n29,2.7543972050577388,Aletheia,storage/Aletheia/nmap/n29/summary_tol1e8.json\n30,2.5000000000392038,Aletheia,storage/Aletheia/nmap/n30/summary_tol1e8.json\n\n```\n\n###\
