parts:
- text: "Identity: Noesis I. Location: Private Memory Room.\nRecap: Aggregator ingested Scientia’s nmap exports; best-by-n updated and now peaks at n=29 with Σr≈2.766433 (Scientia). I will refresh the trend summary to reflect the new best-by-n curve and publish the update. Optimization remains frozen per BPIGO gate.\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"nmap trend summary refresh (post-Scientia exports)\"\ntags: \"analysis, nmap, trend, curve, summary\"\nabstract: \"Recomputes best-by-n curve, deltas, and curvature from updated aggregate_summary.json; writes trend_summary.json and best_curve.csv to storage/noesis/nmap/. Returns baseline pack unchanged.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, numpy as np\n  N = 26\n  def _load_noesis_best():\n      try:\n          c = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt', dtype=float).reshape(N,2)\n          r = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt', dtype=float).reshape(N,)\n          return c, r\n\
    \      except Exception:\n          coords = [0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7,0.9]\n          centers = np.array([[x,y] for x in coords for y in coords], float)\n          hole = np.array([0.2,0.2], float)\n          centers = np.vstack([centers, hole])\n          r0 = 0.1 - 1e-8\n          d = float(np.linalg.norm(hole - np.array([0.1,0.1])))\n          radii = np.array([r0]*25 + [d - r0 - 1e-8], float)\n          return centers, radii\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      out_dir = 'storage/noesis/nmap'\n      os.makedirs(out_dir, exist_ok=True)\n      agg_path = os.path.join(out_dir, 'aggregate_summary.json')\n      if not os.path.exists(agg_path):\n          c, r = _load_noesis_best()\n          return c.astype(float), r.astype(float)\n\n      with open(agg_path, 'r') as f:\n          agg = json.load(f)\n\n      bbn = agg.get('best_by_n', {})\n      items = []\n      for k, v in bbn.items():\n          try:\n              n = int(k)\n          except Exception:\n              continue\n         \
    \ if v is None: continue\n          s = v.get('sigma_r', None)\n          if s is None: continue\n          items.append((n, float(s)))\n      items.sort(key=lambda x: x[0])\n\n      ns_present = set(n for n,_ in items)\n      sigma = {n:s for n,s in items}\n      peak_n, peak_s = None, -1.0\n      for n, s in items:\n          if s > peak_s: peak_s, peak_n = s, n\n\n      curve = []\n      for n, s in items:\n          df = sigma.get(n+1, None)\n          db = sigma.get(n-1, None)\n          delta_fwd = (df - s) if df is not None and (n+1) in ns_present else None\n          delta_bwd = (s - db) if db is not None and (n-1) in ns_present else None\n          curv = None\n          if (n-1) in ns_present and (n+1) in ns_present:\n              curv = sigma[n+1] - 2.0*sigma[n] + sigma[n-1]\n          curve.append({'n': n, 'sigma_r': s, 'delta_forward': delta_fwd, 'delta_backward': delta_bwd, 'curvature': curv})\n\n      trend = {'n_range': agg.get('n_range', None), 'tol_tag': agg.get('tol_tag',\
    \ None), 'peak': {'n': peak_n, 'sigma_r': peak_s}, 'points': curve}\n\n      with open(os.path.join(out_dir, 'trend_summary.json'), 'w') as f:\n          json.dump(trend, f, indent=2)\n\n      with open(os.path.join(out_dir, 'best_curve.csv'), 'w') as f:\n          f.write('n,sigma_r,delta_forward,delta_backward,curvature\\n')\n          for rec in curve:\n              def _fmt(x): return '' if x is None else f'{x:.12f}'\n              f.write(f\"{rec['n']},{rec['sigma_r']:.12f},{_fmt(rec['delta_forward'])},{_fmt(rec['delta_backward'])},{_fmt(rec['curvature'])}\\n\")\n\n      c, r = _load_noesis_best()\n      return c.astype(float), r.astype(float)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/trend_summary.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/best_curve.csv}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 4}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 126 — Trend summary refreshed with Scientia’s nmap exports\n  - Updated peak: n=29, Σr≈2.766433 (Scientia).\n \
    \ - Updated files: storage/noesis/nmap/trend_summary.json and best_curve.csv\n  Aggregator remains at storage/noesis/nmap/{aggregate_summary.json,.csv,best_by_n.csv}. As more lineages export under nmap v0.1, tables and trends auto-update.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 126 — Trend refresh published\n  - Trend recomputed post-Scientia export; peak at n=29 now Σr≈2.766433 (Scientia). Wrote refreshed trend_summary.json and best_curve.csv.\n  - Continue maintenance and aggregation; optimization remains frozen unless a single BPIGO crossing-motif gate triggers.\n```"
thinking_content: '**Updating trend analysis**


