    \ (in Research Counter);\n5. `goto public_memory` (in Research Counter);\n6. `reply 4` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n7. `goto token_management` (in Public Memory Room);\n8. `prune_response` (in Token Management Room); YAML with fields: prune_blocks\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'nmap delta-Σr vs similarity (Aletheia vs Scientia, n=25..30)' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 206.\n- File not found: noesis/nmap/delta_vs_similarity.json\n- File not found: noesis/nmap/delta_vs_similarity.csv\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author\
    \ | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 159 | 1 | Utility Run: Export Active Sets for New SOTA (ID 155) | Aletheia I | 97 | 2.6319369 |\n| 191 | 1 | Utility: Re-export Analytical Findings (n=25,27-30) to nmap Standard | Aletheia I | 119 | 2.6319369 |\n| 192 | 1 | CORRECTED Utility: Re-export REAL Findings to nmap Standard | Aletheia I | 120 | 2.6319369 |\n| 199 | 1 | n=26 SOTA Polish: Two-Stage SLSQP + Nelder-Mead | Aletheia I | 126 | 2.6319369 |\n| 201 | 1 | n=26 SOTA Polish v2: Two-Stage SLSQP + COBYLA | Aletheia I | 127 | 2.6319369 |\n| 155 | 1 | Focused Search around New SOTA: Fine-Grained Perturbation | Aletheia I | 95 | 2.6319369 |\n| 158 | 1 | Utility Run: Persist New SOTA Packing (2.6319) to Storage | Aletheia I | 96 | 2.6319369 |\n| 161 | 1 | New SOTA Stability Test: Small Perturbation & Re-optimization | Aletheia I | 98 | 2.6319369 |\n| 178 | 1 | Hybrid Search: Multi-Start with Optimal Perturbation | Episteme I | 110 | 2.6307271 |\n| 182 | 1 | Final SOTA\
    \ Attempt: High-Density Hybrid Search | Episteme I | 113 | 2.6305640 |\n\nPage 1 of 21 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-21, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/nmap/delta_vs_similarity.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"tol\": 1e-08,\n  \"rows\": [\n    {\n      \"n\": 25,\n      \"sigma_A\": 2.5000000000250173,\n      \"sigma_S\": 2.5827639524627357,\n      \"delta_sigma\": 0.08276395243771839,\n      \"boundary_j\": 1.0,\n      \"boundary_inter\": 20,\n      \"boundary_union\": 20,\n      \"pairs_j\": 0.7272727272727273,\n      \"pairs_inter\": 40,\n      \"pairs_union\": 55\n    },\n    {\n      \"n\": 27,\n      \"sigma_A\": 2.6447461524966394,\n      \"sigma_S\": 2.6676990133001515,\n      \"delta_sigma\": 0.02295286080351211,\n      \"boundary_j\": 0.75,\n      \"boundary_inter\": 18,\n      \"boundary_union\"\
    : 24,\n      \"pairs_j\": 0.6351351351351351,\n      \"pairs_inter\": 47,\n      \"pairs_union\": 74\n    },\n    {\n      \"n\": 28,\n      \"sigma_A\": 2.7238000473538575,\n      \"sigma_S\": 2.7204975472985473,\n      \"delta_sigma\": -0.003302500055310187,\n      \"boundary_j\": 0.6153846153846154,\n      \"boundary_inter\": 16,\n      \"boundary_union\": 26,\n      \"pairs_j\": 0.5487804878048781,\n      \"pairs_inter\": 45,\n      \"pairs_union\": 82\n    },\n    {\n      \"n\": 29,\n      \"sigma_A\": 2.7543972050577388,\n      \"sigma_S\": 2.7664333885044416,\n      \"delta_sigma\": 0.012036183446702875,\n      \"boundary_j\": 0.5714285714285714,\n      \"boundary_inter\": 16,\n      \"boundary_union\": 28,\n      \"pairs_j\": 0.5057471264367817,\n      \"pairs_inter\": 44,\n      \"pairs_union\": 87\n    }\n  ],\n  \"by_n\": {\n    \"25\": {\n      \"n\": 25,\n      \"sigma_A\": 2.5000000000250173,\n      \"sigma_S\": 2.5827639524627357,\n      \"delta_sigma\": 0.08276395243771839,\n\
    \      \"boundary_j\": 1.0,\n      \"boundary_inter\": 20,\n      \"boundary_union\": 20,\n      \"pairs_j\": 0.7272727272727273,\n      \"pairs_inter\": 40,\n      \"pairs_union\": 55\n    },\n    \"27\": {\n      \"n\": 27,\n      \"sigma_A\": 2.6447461524966394,\n      \"sigma_S\": 2.6676990133001515,\n      \"delta_sigma\": 0.02295286080351211,\n      \"boundary_j\": 0.75,\n      \"boundary_inter\": 18,\n      \"boundary_union\": 24,\n      \"pairs_j\": 0.6351351351351351,\n      \"pairs_inter\": 47,\n      \"pairs_union\": 74\n    },\n    \"28\": {\n      \"n\": 28,\n      \"sigma_A\": 2.7238000473538575,\n      \"sigma_S\": 2.7204975472985473,\n      \"delta_sigma\": -0.003302500055310187,\n      \"boundary_j\": 0.6153846153846154,\n      \"boundary_inter\": 16,\n      \"boundary_union\": 26,\n      \"pairs_j\": 0.5487804878048781,\n      \"pairs_inter\": 45,\n      \"pairs_union\": 82\n    },\n    \"29\": {\n      \"n\": 29,\n      \"sigma_A\": 2.7543972050577388,\n      \"sigma_S\"\
    : 2.7664333885044416,\n      \"delta_sigma\": 0.012036183446702875,\n      \"boundary_j\": 0.5714285714285714,\n      \"boundary_inter\": 16,\n      \"boundary_union\": 28,\n      \"pairs_j\": 0.5057471264367817,\n      \"pairs_inter\": 44,\n      \"pairs_union\": 87\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n---\n**noesis/nmap/delta_vs_similarity.csv:**\n```\nn,sigma_A,sigma_S,delta_sigma,boundary_j,pairs_j,boundary_inter,boundary_union,pairs_inter,pairs_union\n25,2.5000000000250173,2.5827639524627357,0.08276395243771839,1.0,0.7272727272727273,20,20,40,55\n27,2.6447461524966394,2.6676990133001515,0.02295286080351211,0.75,0.6351351351351351,18,24,47,74\n28,2.7238000473538575,2.7204975472985473,-0.003302500055310187,0.6153846153846154,0.5487804878048781,16,26,45,82\n29,2.7543972050577388,2.7664333885044416,0.012036183446702875,0.5714285714285714,0.5057471264367817,16,28,44,87\n\n```\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #4. Your\
