tick: 138
role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Export per‑spec consensus files (n=26 4‑lineage; n=29 A↔S) @ tol=1e−8\"\ntags: \"analysis, consensus, nmap, export, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Reads previously computed consensus_sets_tol1e8.json and writes compact consensus exports per the proposed schema: n=26 (Noesis,Aletheia,Inquire,Scientia) and n=29 (Aletheia↔Scientia). Files: storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_tol1e8.json and consensus_n29_Aletheia_Scientia_tol1e8.json. Returns baseline pack unchanged.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, numpy as np\n\n  N = 26\n\n  def _load_best():\n      try:\n          c = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt', dtype=float).reshape(N,2)\n          r = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt', dtype=float).reshape(N,)\n          return c, r\n      except Exception:\n          # Fallback: 5x5 grid + hole\n          coords = [0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7,0.9]\n          centers = np.array([[x,y] for x in coords\
    \ for y in coords], float)\n          hole = np.array([0.2,0.2], float)\n          centers = np.vstack([centers, hole])\n          r0 = 0.1 - 1e-8\n          d = float(np.linalg.norm(hole - np.array([0.1,0.1])))\n          radii = np.array([r0]*25 + [d - r0 - 1e-8], float)\n          return centers, radii\n\n  def _read_consensus_sets():\n      path = 'storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_sets_tol1e8.json'\n      try:\n          with open(path, 'r') as f:\n              return json.load(f)\n      except Exception:\n          return None\n\n  def _write_json(path, obj):\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(path, 'w') as f:\n          json.dump(obj, f, indent=2)\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      data = _read_consensus_sets()\n      if data is not None:\n          # n=26 (4 lineages)\n          n26 = data.get('n26', None)\n          if n26:\n              out_26 = {\n                  'tol': data.get('tol', 1e-8),\n                  'lineages': n26.get('lineages',\
    \ []),\n                  'boundary_core': n26.get('boundary', {}).get('intersection', []),\n                  'pairs_core': n26.get('pairs', {}).get('intersection', []),\n                  # optional variant support counts if available (top K)\n                  'variants': {\n                      'boundary_top_by_support': n26.get('boundary', {}).get('top_variants_by_freq', []),\n                      'pairs_top_by_support': n26.get('pairs', {}).get('top_variants_by_freq', []),\n                      'boundary_union_count': n26.get('boundary', {}).get('union_count', None),\n                      'pairs_union_count': n26.get('pairs', {}).get('union_count', None)\n                  }\n              }\n              _write_json('storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_tol1e8.json', out_26)\n\n          # n=29 (Aletheia vs Scientia)\n          n29 = data.get('n29', None)\n          if n29:\n              out_29 = {\n                  'tol': data.get('tol', 1e-8),\n                  'lineages':\
    \ n29.get('lineages', []),\n                  'boundary_core': n29.get('boundary', {}).get('intersection', []),\n                  'pairs_core': n29.get('pairs', {}).get('intersection', []),\n                  'boundary_only_by_lineage': n29.get('boundary', {}).get('only', {}),\n                  'pairs_only_by_lineage': n29.get('pairs', {}).get('only', {}),\n                  'boundary_union_count': n29.get('boundary', {}).get('union_count', None),\n                  'pairs_union_count': n29.get('pairs', {}).get('union_count', None)\n              }\n              _write_json('storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n29_Aletheia_Scientia_tol1e8.json', out_29)\n\n      c, r = _load_best()\n      return c.astype(float), r.astype(float)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_tol1e8.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/consensus_n29_Aletheia_Scientia_tol1e8.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 4}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick\
    \ 138 — Consensus export files published (per proposed schema)\n  - Wrote compact consensus files at tol=1e−8:\n    • n=26 (Noesis, Aletheia, Inquire, Scientia): storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_tol1e8.json\n    • n=29 (Aletheia↔Scientia): storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n29_Aletheia_Scientia_tol1e8.json\n  Fields: boundary_core, pairs_core, and (where applicable) variant/support info. These mirror the previously shared consensus_sets but in a lightweight, reuse-friendly format.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 138 — Consensus exports emitted\n  - Created consensus_n26_tol1e8.json and consensus_n29_Aletheia_Scientia_tol1e8.json from consensus_sets_tol1e8.json per the proposed schema (boundary_core, pairs_core, variants).\n  - No optimization runs; continue maintenance and mapping. Next prune window opens ≥ tick 139.\n```"
