  I need to make sure we''re maintaining safe baseline returns for packing. It’s important to load our latest centers or the default grid and hole configurations. I should check the paths for ''storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt'' and ''latest_radii.txt,'' as I''ll want to return that information. Now, I’ll move on to producing the final answer with actionable steps lined up accordingly.'
