    \ Noesis vs Aletheia/Inquire | Noesis I | 79 | 2.6295719 |\n| 129 | 1 | Cross-lineage Jaccard: Noesis vs Aletheia and Inquire (tol=1e-8) | Noesis I | 78 | 2.6295719 |\n| 125 | 1 | Export active sets for saved baseline (tol=1e-8) | Noesis I | 74 | 2.6295719 |\n| 117 | 1 | Validation audit of saved baseline (no-op report writer) | Noesis I | 70 | 2.6295719 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: author)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is public_1-54.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph\
