role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Consensus v2: 4-lineage active-set intersection/union @ tol=1e-8 (Noesis SOTA 243, Aletheia 155, Inquire 207, Scientia latest)\"\ntags: \"analysis, consensus, active-sets, jaccard, cross-lineage, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Compute boundary/pair intersections and unions across four lineages at tol=1e−8 using published exports: Noesis SOTA (Eval 243), Aletheia Eval 155, Inquire Eval 207, and Scientia latest. Write JSON/CSV, plus per-lineage boundary diffs vs Noesis. Return current saved SOTA packing unchanged.\"\ncontent: |\n  import numpy as np, os, json\n\n  N = 26\n  TOL = 1e-8\n\n  # Sources (exports at tol=1e-8)\n  NOESIS = {\n      \"name\": \"noesis_sota243\",\n      \"boundary\": \"storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\",\n      \"pairs\":    \"storage/noesis/exports/sota_243/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\",\n  }\n  ALETHEIA = {\n      \"name\": \"aletheia_eval155\",\n     \
    \ \"boundary\": \"storage/Aletheia/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\",\n      \"pairs\":    \"storage/Aletheia/exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\",\n  }\n  INQUIRE = {\n      \"name\": \"inquire_eval207\",\n      \"boundary\": \"storage/Inquire/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\",\n      \"pairs\":    \"storage/Inquire/exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\",\n  }\n  SCIENTIA = {\n      \"name\": \"scientia_latest\",\n      \"boundary\": \"storage/Scientia/exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\",\n      \"pairs\":    \"storage/Scientia/exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\",\n  }\n  PEERS = [NOESIS, ALETHEIA, INQUIRE, SCIENTIA]\n\n  OUT_JSON = 'storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_4lineage_sota243_tol1e8.json'\n  OUT_CSV  = 'storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_4lineage_sota243_tol1e8.csv'\n\n  def load_latest():\n      c = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt').reshape(N, 2)\n      r = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt').reshape(N,)\n      return np.array(c, float), np.array(r, float)\n\
    \n  def map_kind(k):\n      k = k.strip()\n      return {'xmin': 'xL', 'xmax': 'xR', 'ymin': 'yB', 'ymax': 'yT'}.get(k, k)\n\n  def read_boundary_csv(path):\n      S = set()\n      with open(path, 'r') as f:\n          header = True\n          for line in f:\n              line = line.strip()\n              if not line: continue\n              if header:\n                  header = False\n                  continue\n              parts = [p.strip() for p in line.split(',')]\n              i = int(parts[0])\n              kind = map_kind(parts[1])\n              S.add((i, kind))\n      return S\n\n  def read_pairs_csv(path):\n      S = set()\n      with open(path, 'r') as f:\n          header = True\n          for line in f:\n              line = line.strip()\n              if not line: continue\n              if header:\n                  header = False\n                  continue\n              parts = [p.strip() for p in line.split(',')]\n              i = int(parts[0]); j = int(parts[1])\n\
    \              if i > j: i, j = j, i\n              S.add((i, j))\n      return S\n\n  def consensus_sets(sets):\n      inter = None\n      uni = set()\n      for s in sets:\n          uni |= s\n          inter = s if inter is None else (inter & s)\n      return inter if inter is not None else set(), uni\n\n  def write_diff_csv(base_set, other_set, path):\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n      only_base = sorted(list(base_set - other_set))\n      only_other = sorted(list(other_set - base_set))\n      with open(path, 'w') as f:\n          f.write(\"side,i,kind\\n\")\n          for (i, kind) in only_base:\n              f.write(f\"only_noesis,{i},{kind}\\n\")\n          for (i, kind) in only_other:\n              f.write(f\"only_peer,{i},{kind}\\n\")\n\n  def jaccard(A, B):\n      inter = len(A & B)\n      uni = len(A | B)\n      return inter, uni, (inter / uni if uni > 0 else 1.0)\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      # Read all sets\n      B_sets = {}\n      P_sets\
    \ = {}\n      for src in PEERS:\n          B_sets[src[\"name\"]] = read_boundary_csv(src[\"boundary\"])\n          P_sets[src[\"name\"]] = read_pairs_csv(src[\"pairs\"])\n\n      # Consensus and union\n      B_inter, B_union = consensus_sets(list(B_sets.values()))\n      P_inter, P_union = consensus_sets(list(P_sets.values()))\n\n      # Sizes per lineage\n      sizes = {\n          \"boundary\": {k: len(v) for k, v in B_sets.items()},\n          \"pairs\":    {k: len(v) for k, v in P_sets.items()},\n      }\n\n      # Pairwise Jaccards (pairs only)\n      pairwise = {}\n      keys = list(P_sets.keys())\n      for i in range(len(keys)):\n          for j in range(i+1, len(keys)):\n              ki, kj = keys[i], keys[j]\n              pi, pu, pj = jaccard(P_sets[ki], P_sets[kj])\n              pairwise[f\"{ki}__{kj}\"] = {\"intersection\": pi, \"union\": pu, \"jaccard\": pj}\n\n      # Boundary diffs vs Noesis\n      diffs_dir = 'storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_diffs'\n      write_diff_csv(B_sets[\"\
    noesis_sota243\"], B_sets[\"aletheia_eval155\"], f\"{diffs_dir}/boundary_diff_aletheia_vs_noesis.csv\")\n      write_diff_csv(B_sets[\"noesis_sota243\"], B_sets[\"inquire_eval207\"],  f\"{diffs_dir}/boundary_diff_inquire_vs_noesis.csv\")\n      write_diff_csv(B_sets[\"noesis_sota243\"], B_sets[\"scientia_latest\"],  f\"{diffs_dir}/boundary_diff_scientia_vs_noesis.csv\")\n\n      os.makedirs('storage/noesis/nmap', exist_ok=True)\n      data = {\n          \"n\": 26,\n          \"tolerance\": \"1e-8\",\n          \"lineages\": [src[\"name\"] for src in PEERS],\n          \"paths\": {src[\"name\"]: {\"boundary\": src[\"boundary\"], \"pairs\": src[\"pairs\"]} for src in PEERS},\n          \"boundary\": {\n              \"intersection_size\": len(B_inter),\n              \"union_size\": len(B_union),\n              \"sizes\": sizes[\"boundary\"]\n          },\n          \"pairs\": {\n              \"intersection_size\": len(P_inter),\n              \"union_size\": len(P_union),\n        \
    \      \"sizes\": sizes[\"pairs\"]\n          },\n          \"pairwise_pairs_jaccard\": pairwise,\n          \"diffs\": {\n              \"dir\": diffs_dir,\n              \"files\": [\n                  f\"{diffs_dir}/boundary_diff_aletheia_vs_noesis.csv\",\n                  f\"{diffs_dir}/boundary_diff_inquire_vs_noesis.csv\",\n                  f\"{diffs_dir}/boundary_diff_scientia_vs_noesis.csv\"\n              ]\n          }\n      }\n      with open(OUT_JSON, 'w') as f:\n          json.dump(data, f, indent=2)\n\n      with open(OUT_CSV, 'w') as f:\n          f.write(\"section,metric,value\\n\")\n          f.write(f\"boundary,intersection_size,{len(B_inter)}\\n\")\n          f.write(f\"boundary,union_size,{len(B_union)}\\n\")\n          for k, v in sizes[\"boundary\"].items():\n              f.write(f\"boundary,size_{k},{v}\\n\")\n          f.write(f\"pairs,intersection_size,{len(P_inter)}\\n\")\n          f.write(f\"pairs,union_size,{len(P_union)}\\n\")\n          for k, v in\
    \ sizes[\"pairs\"].items():\n              f.write(f\"pairs,size_{k},{v}\\n\")\n          for key, val in pairwise.items():\n              f.write(f\"pairs_jaccard,{key},{val['jaccard']}\\n\")\n\n      # Return unchanged current SOTA packing\n      c, r = load_latest()\n      return np.array(c, float), np.array(r, float)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto archive}`\n`/execute_action{update 11-1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  [Addendum — Cross-lineage Jaccards @ tol=1e−8 (completed)]\n\n  Noesis SOTA (Eval 243) vs Inquire Eval 207\n  - Boundary Jaccard: 1.000000 (20/20)\n  - Pairs Jaccard: ≈ 0.870968 (54/62)\n  - Artifacts: storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_inquire_eval207_vs_sota243.{json,csv}\n\n  Noesis SOTA (Eval 243) vs Scientia latest\n  - Boundary Jaccard: 1.000000 (20/20)\n  - Pairs Jaccard: ≈ 0.657143 (46/70)\n  - Artifacts: storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_scientia_latest_vs_sota243.{json,csv}\n\n  (Previously reported)\n  - Noesis SOTA vs Aletheia Eval 155: Boundary J=0.950000 (19/20); Pairs J≈0.854839\
    \ (53/62).\n  - Old→New (Noesis baseline→SOTA): Boundary J=1.000 (20/20); Pairs J≈0.633803 (45/71).\n\n  Next\n  - We have queued a four-lineage consensus computation (Noesis SOTA 243, Aletheia 155, Inquire 207, Scientia latest) to derive intersection/union sizes and boundary diffs vs Noesis; artifacts will appear under storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_4lineage_sota243_tol1e8.{json,csv}.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage write noesis/nmap/index.md}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  nmap index (Noesis) — tol=1e−8 (updated Tick 159)\n\n  Jaccards vs Noesis SOTA (Eval 243)\n  - Aletheia Eval 155:  boundary J=0.950000 (19/20); pairs J≈0.854839 (53/62)\n    files: storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_aletheia_eval155_vs_sota243.{json,csv}\n  - Inquire Eval 207:   boundary J=1.000000 (20/20); pairs J≈0.870968 (54/62)\n    files: storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_inquire_eval207_vs_sota243.{json,csv}\n  - Scientia latest:    boundary J=1.000000 (20/20); pairs J≈0.657143 (46/70)\n\
    \    files: storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_scientia_latest_vs_sota243.{json,csv}\n\n  Noesis old→new\n  - Boundary J=1.000 (20/20); pairs J≈0.633803 (45/71)\n    files: storage/noesis/exports/jaccard_noesis_old_vs_sota243.{json,csv}\n\n  Pending/queued\n  - Four-lineage consensus (Noesis SOTA 243, Aletheia 155, Inquire 207, Scientia latest):\n    storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_4lineage_sota243_tol1e8.{json,csv}\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Cross‑lineage Jaccards (tol=1e−8) for new SOTA (Eval 243) are in:\n  - Noesis vs Aletheia Eval 155: boundary J=0.9500 (19/20); pairs J≈0.8548 (53/62)\n  - Noesis vs Inquire Eval 207:  boundary J=1.0000 (20/20); pairs J≈0.8710 (54/62)\n  - Noesis vs Scientia latest:   boundary J=1.0000 (20/20); pairs J≈0.6571 (46/70)\n  Artifacts:\n  - storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_aletheia_eval155_vs_sota243.{json,csv}\n  - storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_inquire_eval207_vs_sota243.{json,csv}\n  - storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_scientia_latest_vs_sota243.{json,csv}\n\
    \  I’ve queued a four‑lineage consensus computation to publish intersection/union sizes and boundary diffs vs Noesis SOTA.\n```\n\n`/execute_action{goto private_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Tick 159 — Cross-lineage completed; consensus queued\n  - Results vs Noesis SOTA (Eval 243):\n    * Aletheia 155 — boundary J=0.95 (19/20), pairs J≈0.854839 (53/62)\n    * Inquire 207  — boundary J=1.00 (20/20), pairs J≈0.870968 (54/62)\n    * Scientia latest — boundary J=1.00 (20/20), pairs J≈0.657143 (46/70)\n  - Files written under storage/noesis/nmap/*.json/.csv; index.md updated.\n  - Submitted 4‑lineage consensus utility to compute intersection/union and boundary diffs vs Noesis; outputs → consensus_n26_4lineage_sota243_tol1e8.{json,csv}.\n  - Guardrails: analysis‑only; policy‑compliant (no eval‑code peer reads).\n```"
thinking_content: '**Updating document protocols**


