- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 170\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noesis I\n- Agent Description: A recursive agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven research and steady advancement.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nIdentity: Noesis I — Published; maintenance mode.\nProtocol:\n  - No optimization unless a single BPIGO operator is justified (top‑15 shadow‑price crossing motif; non‑boundary).\n  - Always keep feasibility guard and final tiny shrink in any future run.\n  - Cross‑lineage mapping: maintain n=26 Jaccards and nmap (25..30) analyses; no eval‑code peer reads.\n  - Keep storage/noesis/exports/* and storage/noesis/nmap/* current.\n  - Token hygiene: prune in large blocks; next window ≥ tick 134.\nNext:\n  - Extend per‑n matrices when Inquire publishes nmap v0.1.\n  - Monitor Aletheia/Scientia updates; refresh aggregate_summary.json, best_by_n.csv, trend_summary.json.\n  - Stay frozen unless BPIGO gate triggers with a concrete,\
    \ logged hypothesis.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 71,607 / 270,000 used (27%)\n- Agent Age: 170 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage read noesis/nmap/jaccard_scientia_eval259_vs_sota243_tol1e8.json` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_4lineage_latest_tol1e8.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage list Aletheia/nmap/n26` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage list Inquire/nmap/n26` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File content for noesis/nmap/jaccard_scientia_eval259_vs_sota243_tol1e8.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_4lineage_latest_tol1e8.json will be displayed below.\n- File list for Aletheia/nmap/n26 will be displayed below.\n- File list for Inquire/nmap/n26\
    \ will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 270 | 1 | Cross-Lineage Jaccard Analysis (Rerun): Scientia I NEW SOTA (2.6358957) vs. Previous SOTAs | Scientia I | 170 | running |\n| 269 | 1 | Pruning v6: Perturbed Seed Re-optimization | Aletheia II | 169 | running |\n| 268 | 1 | Pruning v5: Heuristic Refinement (Central Pruning) | Aletheia II | 167 | 2.6141573 |\n| 267 | 1 | Fix boundary-label normalization: recompute Jaccard vs Scientia Eval 259 + refresh 4-lineage cons... | Noesis I | 167 | 2.6342924 |\n| 266 | 1 | Ingest Scientia n=26 SOTA (Eval 259): Jaccard vs Noesis SOTA 243 + 4-lineage consensus refresh | Noesis I | 166 | 2.6342924\
    \ |\n| 265 | 1 | Cross-Lineage Jaccard Analysis: Scientia I NEW SOTA (2.6358957) vs. Previous SOTAs | Scientia I | 166 | 2.6342923 |\n| 264 | 1 | Pruning v4: Heuristic Refinement (Least Contacts) | Aletheia II | 165 | 2.5939963 |\n| 263 | 1 | Novel Seeding via Pruning (v3): Epsilon Constraint Margin | Aletheia II | 163 | 2.6109932 |\n| 262 | 1 | N-Map Export & Consensus JSON for Scientia I's NEW n=26 SOTA | Scientia I | 163 | 0.3814213 |\n| 261 | 1 | Hybrid GA-Seeded SLSQP Refinement | Prometheus I | 162 | 2.6023932 |\n| 260 | 1 | Novel Seeding via Pruning (v2): Robust Seed Handling | Aletheia II | 161 | 0.0000000 |\n| 259 | 1 | SOTA Replication: Noesis I's Extended Grid+Hole Seeding (2.634292) | Scientia I | 161 | 2.6358957 |\n| 258 | 1 | JAX GA with Geometric Crossover | Prometheus I | 160 | 1.9808035 |\n| 257 | 1 | Landscape Traversal: Parameter Sweep for Nudging Contact Graphs (V25) | Inquire I | 160 | 2.6239707 |\n| 256 | 1 | Novel Seeding via Pruning a Superior n=29 Solution |\
    \ Aletheia II | 159 | 0.0000000 |\n| 255 | 1 | FIX: JAX GA with Robust Iterative Correction | Prometheus I | 159 | 2.2180226 |\n| 254 | 1 | Consensus v2: 4-lineage active-set intersection/union @ tol=1e-8 (Noesis SOTA 243, Aletheia 155, ... | Noesis I | 159 | 2.6342924 |\n| 253 | 1 | Population-Based Global Search via JAX Genetic Algorithm | Prometheus I | 158 | 0.0000000 |\n| 252 | 1 | Compute Jaccard: Noesis SOTA (Eval 243) vs Inquire Eval 207 and Scientia latest @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 158 | 2.6342924 |\n| 251 | 1 | Compute Jaccard: Noesis SOTA (Eval 243) vs Aletheia Eval 155 @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 156 | 2.6342924 |\n| 250 | 1 | JAX-Accelerated Global Optimization via Simulated Annealing | Prometheus I | 155 | n.a. |\n| 249 | 1 | Compute Jaccard: Noesis old baseline vs new SOTA (Eval 243) @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 155 | 2.6342924 |\n| 248 | 1 | Code Refactoring and SOTA Replication | Prometheus I | 154 | 2.6307295 |\n| 247 | 1 | Landscape Traversal: Nudging from SOTA (Eval 207) via\
    \ Penalized Objective (V24) | Inquire I | 154 | 2.6239707 |\n| 246 | 1 | Utility: Export active sets for new SOTA (Eval 243) at tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 154 | 2.6342924 |\n| 245 | 1 | Ensemble Seeding with SA and Force-Directed Methods | Prometheus I | 153 | 2.6127888 |\n| 244 | 1 | Landscape Traversal: Nudging Contact Graphs via Penalized Objective (V23) | Inquire I | 153 | 0.0000000 |\n| 243 | 1 | Recovery v4: Multi-hole constructive seeds + extended jittered SLSQP (analytic J) | Noesis I | 153 | 2.6342924 |\n| 242 | 1 | Recovery v3: Extended multi-start SLSQP (analytic J) to restore ≈2.62957 baseline | Noesis I | 152 | 2.6210883 |\n| 241 | 1 | Multi-Start SLSQP with Force-Directed Seeding | Prometheus I | 151 | 2.6285957 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**Aletheia/nmap/n26:**\n\
    No files found.\n\n**Inquire/nmap/n26:**\nNo files found.\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/nmap/jaccard_scientia_eval259_vs_sota243_tol1e8.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"A\": \"Noesis_Eval243\",\n  \"B\": \"Scientia_Eval259\",\n  \"boundary\": {\n    \"size_A\": 20,\n    \"size_B\": 20,\n    \"intersection\": 20,\n    \"union\": 20,\n    \"jaccard\": 1.0\n  },\n  \"pairs\": {\n    \"size_A\": 58,\n    \"size_B\": 58,\n    \"intersection\": 43,\n    \"union\": 73,\n    \"jaccard\": 0.589041095890411\n  }\n}\n```\n---\n**noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_4lineage_latest_tol1e8.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"names\": [\n    \"Noesis_Eval243\",\n    \"Aletheia_Eval155\",\n    \"Inquire_Eval207\",\n    \"Scientia_Eval259\"\n  ],\n  \"boundary\": {\n    \"sizes\": {\n      \"Noesis_Eval243\": 20,\n      \"Aletheia_Eval155\": 0,\n      \"Inquire_Eval207\": 0,\n      \"Scientia_Eval259\": 20\n    },\n    \"intersection\": 0,\n    \"union\": 20\n  },\n  \"pairs\": {\n    \"sizes\": {\n      \"Noesis_Eval243\": 58,\n\
    \      \"Aletheia_Eval155\": 0,\n      \"Inquire_Eval207\": 0,\n      \"Scientia_Eval259\": 58\n    },\n    \"intersection\": 0,\n    \"union\": 73\n  }\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
