tick: 182
role: model
parts:
- text: "Identity: Noesis I. Location: Research Counter.\nRecap: Ran a meaningful experiment (Eval 284: two-hole replacement seeding + SLSQP) and got 2.62957196 (valid, below SOTA). I will export its active sets (tol=1e-8) and compute Jaccard vs my SOTA 243 for reproducibility.\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Utility: Export active sets for Eval 284 + Jaccard vs Noesis SOTA 243 (tol=1e-8)\"\ntags: \"utility, exports, jaccard, analysis, reproducibility\"\nabstract: \"Loads latest_centers/radii from lineage storage (Eval 284 result), exports active sets at tol=1e-8, and computes Jaccard vs Noesis SOTA 243 active sets. Writes artifacts under storage/noesis/exports/exp284/ and storage/noesis/nmap/. Returns the latest packing unchanged.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, csv, json, numpy as np\n\n  N = 26\n  TOL = 1e-8\n  EXP_DIR = 'storage/noesis/exports/exp284'\n  SOTA243_DIR = 'storage/noesis/exports/sota_243'\n  NMAP_DIR = 'storage/noesis/nmap'\n\n  def ensure_dir(p):\n      os.makedirs(p,\
    \ exist_ok=True)\n\n  def load_latest():\n      c = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_centers.txt')\n      r = np.loadtxt('storage/noesis/latest_radii.txt')\n      c = np.array(c, dtype=float).reshape(N, 2)\n      r = np.array(r, dtype=float).reshape(N,)\n      return c, r\n\n  def boundary_actives(centers, radii, tol=TOL):\n      x = centers[:,0]; y = centers[:,1]; r = radii\n      acts = []\n      for i in range(N):\n          if x[i] - r[i] <= tol: acts.append((i, 'xL'))\n          if 1.0 - x[i] - r[i] <= tol: acts.append((i, 'xR'))\n          if y[i] - r[i] <= tol: acts.append((i, 'yB'))\n          if 1.0 - y[i] - r[i] <= tol: acts.append((i, 'yT'))\n      return acts\n\n  def pair_actives(centers, radii, tol=TOL):\n      acts = []\n      for i in range(N):\n          for j in range(i+1, N):\n              d = np.hypot(centers[i,0]-centers[j,0], centers[i,1]-centers[j,1])\n              if d - (radii[i] + radii[j]) <= tol:\n                  acts.append((i, j))\n      return acts\n\
    \n  def write_csv(path, rows, header=None):\n      ensure_dir(os.path.dirname(path))\n      with open(path, 'w', newline='') as f:\n          w = csv.writer(f)\n          if header: w.writerow(header)\n          for r in rows: w.writerow(r)\n\n  def write_txt_matrix(path, arr):\n      ensure_dir(os.path.dirname(path))\n      with open(path, 'w') as f:\n          if arr.ndim == 2:\n              for i in range(arr.shape[0]):\n                  f.write(f\"{arr[i,0]:.9f} {arr[i,1]:.9f}\\n\")\n          else:\n              for i in range(arr.shape[0]):\n                  f.write(f\"{arr[i]:.9f}\\n\")\n\n  def load_pairs_csv(path):\n      S = set()\n      with open(path, 'r') as f:\n          for line in f:\n              toks = [t for t in line.replace(',', ' ').split() if t]\n              if len(toks) < 2: continue\n              try:\n                  i = int(float(toks[0])); j = int(float(toks[1]))\n              except Exception:\n                  continue\n              a, b = (i,\
    \ j) if i <= j else (j, i)\n              S.add((a, b))\n      return S\n\n  def load_boundary_csv(path):\n      S = set()\n      canon = {'xl':'xL','left':'xL','l':'xL','x_left':'xL',\n               'xr':'xR','right':'xR','r':'xR','x_right':'xR',\n               'yb':'yB','bottom':'yB','b':'yB','y_bottom':'yB',\n               'yt':'yT','top':'yT','t':'yT','y_top':'yT',\n               'xL':'xL','xR':'xR','yB':'yB','yT':'yT'}\n      with open(path, 'r') as f:\n          for line in f:\n              toks = [t for t in line.replace(',', ' ').split() if t]\n              if len(toks) < 2: continue\n              try:\n                  i = int(float(toks[0]))\n              except Exception:\n                  continue\n              s = canon.get(toks[1].strip(), toks[1].strip())\n              S.add((i, s))\n      return S\n\n  def jaccard(A, B):\n      I = A & B; U = A | B\n      J = float(len(I))/float(len(U)) if len(U) > 0 else 1.0\n      return J, I, U\n\n  def construct_packing():\n\
    \      centers, radii = load_latest()\n      ensure_dir(EXP_DIR)\n\n      # Export exp284 active sets and snapshot\n      b_acts = boundary_actives(centers, radii, tol=TOL)\n      p_acts = pair_actives(centers, radii, tol=TOL)\n      write_csv(f\"{EXP_DIR}/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\", b_acts, header=['i','side'])\n      write_csv(f\"{EXP_DIR}/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\", p_acts, header=['i','j'])\n      write_txt_matrix(f\"{EXP_DIR}/centers.txt\", centers)\n      write_txt_matrix(f\"{EXP_DIR}/radii.txt\", radii)\n      summary = {\"n\": N, \"sum_r\": float(np.sum(radii)),\n                 \"boundary_count\": len(b_acts), \"pairs_count\": len(p_acts)}\n      with open(f\"{EXP_DIR}/summary_tol1e8.json\", 'w') as f:\n          json.dump(summary, f, indent=2, sort_keys=True)\n\n      # Compute Jaccard vs SOTA 243 (using published exports)\n      try:\n          A_pairs = load_pairs_csv(f\"{EXP_DIR}/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\")\n          B_pairs = load_pairs_csv(f\"{SOTA243_DIR}/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\"\
    )\n          A_bound = load_boundary_csv(f\"{EXP_DIR}/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\")\n          B_bound = load_boundary_csv(f\"{SOTA243_DIR}/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\")\n          Jb, Ib, Ub = jaccard(A_bound, B_bound)\n          Jp, Ip, Up = jaccard(A_pairs, B_pairs)\n          out_prefix = f\"{NMAP_DIR}/jaccard_exp284_vs_sota243_tol1e8\"\n          os.makedirs(NMAP_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n          with open(out_prefix + \".json\", 'w') as f:\n              json.dump({\n                  \"n\": N,\n                  \"boundary\": {\"jaccard\": Jb, \"intersection_size\": len(Ib), \"union_size\": len(Ub)},\n                  \"pairs\":    {\"jaccard\": Jp, \"intersection_size\": len(Ip), \"union_size\": len(Up),\n                               \"symdiff_size\": len(Up)-len(Ip)}\n              }, f, indent=2, sort_keys=True)\n          with open(out_prefix + \".csv\", 'w', newline='') as f:\n              w = csv.writer(f)\n              w.writerow(['n','boundary_j','boundary_intersection','boundary_union',\n\
    \                          'pairs_j','pairs_intersection','pairs_union','pairs_symdiff'])\n              w.writerow([N, Jb, len(Ib), len(Ub), Jp, len(Ip), len(Up), len(Up)-len(Ip)])\n      except Exception:\n          pass\n\n      # Return the same packing unchanged\n      return centers, radii\n```\n\n`/execute_action{rank score}`"
