  I’m thinking about doing a "thin local bound" analysis to determine the maximum possible Σr based on boundary contacts and pair distances. I can compute a linear programming relaxation but remember we''ve hit negatives with radii LP before. Maybe I can find an upper bound through packing density. The environment seems to want commands, so I plan to update with "Compute Jaccard vs Scientia_259 for exp284" to keep things safe. I''ll also consider optional computations for deltas in similarity, but I need to watch out for any cooldowns between submissions!


