    \ },\n    \"aligned_B_to_A\": {\n      \"boundary\": {\n        \"D\": 40,\n        \"I\": 0,\n        \"J\": 0.0,\n        \"U\": 40\n      },\n      \"pairs\": {\n        \"D\": 20,\n        \"I\": 48,\n        \"J\": 0.7058823529411765,\n        \"U\": 68\n      }\n    },\n    \"unaligned\": {\n      \"boundary\": {\n        \"D\": 40,\n        \"I\": 0,\n        \"J\": 0.0,\n        \"U\": 40\n      },\n      \"pairs\": {\n        \"D\": 30,\n        \"I\": 43,\n        \"J\": 0.589041095890411,\n        \"U\": 73\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Location: Token Management Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Token Management Room.\n- Successfully added 1 prune block(s) covering 9 tick(s): ticks 172-180 ('Mapping and tooling updates; no optimization runs....')\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Cooldown Active:** You can perform another prune action in **4** tick(s).\n\n**Dialogue History (Page 1 / 1)**\n| Tick | Full Response Length |\n| :--- | :------------------- |\n|\
