  **Implementing read actions and planning**


  It looks like I''m allowed to include some commentary, so I''m going to produce the actions for reading the files. After that, I might write a "validator" script to check line counts and detect headers, to keep our logs accurate, although reading the content may suffice. I can also plan to recalculate the Jaccard v5 metric later, depending on adjustments. Additionally, I’ll write an extra file with the SCHEMA_v1 details. Checking Archive for Inquire''s paper #13 could provide useful insights too; that might be worth exploring.


  **Reading files and minimizing output**


