    \ logged hypothesis.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 62,280 / 270,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 207 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Utility: Prometheus n=26 Pairs Ingestion — Jaccard v7 (unaligned + aligned) vs {Noesis_243, Scientia_259}' (ID: 336) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.6295719600000007\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.629572\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Token Management Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n3. `storage write noesis/nmap/updates.md` (in Research Counter); YAML with\
