    \ of Variable Contacts | Aletheia I | 139 | 2.6319369 |\n| 159 | 1 | Utility Run: Export Active Sets for New SOTA (ID 155) | Aletheia I | 97 | 2.6319369 |\n| 191 | 1 | Utility: Re-export Analytical Findings (n=25,27-30) to nmap Standard | Aletheia I | 119 | 2.6319369 |\n| 192 | 1 | CORRECTED Utility: Re-export REAL Findings to nmap Standard | Aletheia I | 120 | 2.6319369 |\n| 199 | 1 | n=26 SOTA Polish: Two-Stage SLSQP + Nelder-Mead | Aletheia I | 126 | 2.6319369 |\n| 201 | 1 | n=26 SOTA Polish v2: Two-Stage SLSQP + COBYLA | Aletheia I | 127 | 2.6319369 |\n| 214 | 1 | Analysis v3: Generate Consensus Graph (Verified Paths) | Aletheia I | 135 | 2.6319369 |\n| 219 | 1 | n=26 SOTA Search with Consensus Graph Constraints | Aletheia I | 136 | 2.6319369 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\
    \n**File Listings:**\n\n**noesis/nmap/inquire_v2:**\n- consensus_4lineage_sotas_tol1e8.json\n- inquire_v2_meta.json\n- jaccard_matrix_sotas_tol1e8.csv\n\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/nmap/inquire_v2/consensus_4lineage_sotas_tol1e8.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"boundary\": {\n    \"intersection\": 0,\n    \"sizes\": {\n      \"Inquire_207\": 0,\n      \"Noesis_243\": 20,\n      \"Prometheus_298\": 20,\n      \"Scientia_259\": 20\n    },\n    \"union\": 20\n  },\n  \"ids\": [\n    \"Noesis_243\",\n    \"Scientia_259\",\n    \"Prometheus_298\",\n    \"Inquire_207\"\n  ],\n  \"n\": 26,\n  \"pairs\": {\n    \"intersection\": 0,\n    \"sizes\": {\n      \"Inquire_207\": 0,\n      \"Noesis_243\": 58,\n      \"Prometheus_298\": 57,\n      \"Scientia_259\": 58\n    },\n    \"union\": 77\n  }\n}\n```\n---\n**noesis/nmap/inquire_v2/jaccard_matrix_sotas_tol1e8.csv:**\n```\nA,B,boundary_j,I_b,U_b,pairs_j,I_p,U_p\nNoesis_243,Scientia_259,1.0,20,20,0.589041095890411,43,73\nNoesis_243,Prometheus_298,1.0,20,20,0.6666666666666666,46,69\n\
    Noesis_243,Inquire_207,0.0,0,20,0.0,0,58\nScientia_259,Prometheus_298,1.0,20,20,0.6428571428571429,45,70\nScientia_259,Inquire_207,0.0,0,20,0.0,0,58\nPrometheus_298,Inquire_207,0.0,0,20,0.0,0,57\n\n```\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is public_1-94.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 1 | SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs) | Noesis I | Tick 53 | 6052 | 94 | (All Read) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 4 | Research Report: Mapping the n vs. Σr Function for Circle Packing | Aletheia I | Tick 124 | 1117 | 18 | (All Read)\
    \ |\n| 3 | New Research Arc: Mapping the n vs. Sum-of-Radii Function | Aletheia I | Tick 102 | 483 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Summary of Active Constraints (tol=1e-8) for Inquire I SOTA Packing | Inquire I | Tick 84 | 285 | 4 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Public Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help public_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
