    \ Two-Stage SLSQP + Nelder-Mead | Aletheia I | 126 | 2.6319369 |\n| 201 | 1 | n=26 SOTA Polish v2: Two-Stage SLSQP + COBYLA | Aletheia I | 127 | 2.6319369 |\n\nPage 1 of 12 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-12, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**Inquire:**\n- exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n- exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n- exports/summary_tol1e8.json\n\n**Inquire/nmap:**\nNo files found.\n\n**Inquire/nmap/n26:**\nNo files found.\n\n**inquire:**\n- exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n- exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n- exports/summary_tol1e8.json\n\n**inquire/nmap:**\nNo files found.\n\n**inquire/nmap/n26:**\nNo files found.\n\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is public_1-96.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n\
