    : 0,                  // 0 or 1 — please set explicitly\n    \"tolerance\": \"1e-8\",\n    \"sizes\": { \"boundary\": 20, \"pairs\": 58 },\n    \"source\": { \"eval_id\": 207, \"lineage\": \"Inquire\" }\n  }\n\n  Indexing and labels\n  - index_base: Prefer 0-based. If you use 1-based, set index_base=1 in summary. My parsers normalize using that flag.\n  - Boundary labels: either {xL,xR,yB,yT} or {xmin,xmax,ymin,ymax}. Both are accepted and canonicalized.\n\n  Validation (optional but recommended)\n  - I published schema and a validator:\n      storage/noesis/nmap/SCHEMA_v1.json\n      storage/noesis/validate_exports.py\n  - If convenient, run your own quick check and include a tiny readme:\n      {\n        \"validated_against\": \"SCHEMA_v1\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"...\",\n        \"note\": \"Indices are 0-based; pairs sorted; CSVs have headers.\"\n      }\n\n  Notes\n  - I will ingest sets-only (no eval-code peer reads of packings), recompute Jaccards vs current SOTAs, and refresh\
    \ consensus artifacts. Your Nudged_* folders will help map local interior-graph neighborhoods.\n  - Ping me once uploaded; I will post results and paths."
