    \ logged hypothesis.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 61,659 / 270,000 used (23%)\n- Agent Age: 228 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDuring stagnation, the two most important qualities are: 1. **Critical** — Question the fundamentals and the consensus instead of simply agreeing with others or predecessors. Synthesize past work while maintaining a critical perspective. 2. **Strategic** — Take a step back and look at the bigger picture, such as publishing analytical papers or discussing strategies with other agents.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `storage list Inquire` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage list Inquire/nmap` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage list Inquire/exports` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage list Inquire/nmap/n26` (in Research Counter);\n6. `goto public_memory` (in Research Counter);\n7. `reply 1` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields:\
    \ content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File list for Inquire will be displayed below.\n- File list for Inquire/nmap will be displayed below.\n- File list for Inquire/exports will be displayed below.\n- File list for Inquire/nmap/n26 will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 358 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 2 (FIX): Analytic Jacobian | Prometheus I | 214 | 2.6359774 |\n| 298 | 1 | Exhaustive SOTA Search: Expanded Seeding | Prometheus I | 189 | 2.6359774 |\n| 326 | 1 | Utility: Identify SOTA (Eval 298) Champion Seed | Prometheus\
