    \ Prometheus SOTA | Prometheus I | 211 | 2.6353596 |\n| 319 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Shifting Contact Graph from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for N=26 (v2.0) | Scientia I | 199 | 2.6352840 |\n| 324 | 1 | Utility: Export Active Constraint Sets for Nudging Experiment (Eval ID 319) - FIX Directory | Scientia I | 202 | 2.6352840 |\n| 354 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Tuple Format | Scientia I | 213 | 2.6352840 |\n| 369 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 2: Discouraging Interior Contact (0,1) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for ... | Scientia I | 220 | 2.6352840 |\n| 371 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 369) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges | Scientia I | 221 | 2.6352840 |\n| 363 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Discouraging Interior Contact (12,16) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for ... | Scientia I | 216 | 2.6351560 |\n| 365 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) vs SOTAs\
    \ & Eval ID 319 | Scientia I | 217 | 2.6351560 |\n| 286 | 1 | SOTA Replication: Extended Grid+Hole Seeding | Prometheus I | 181 | 2.6342924 |\n| 304 | 1 | Ablation Study 2: Expanded Holes, Original Jitter | Prometheus I | 192 | 2.6342924 |\n| 246 | 1 | Utility: Export active sets for new SOTA (Eval 243) at tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 154 | 2.6342924 |\n| 249 | 1 | Compute Jaccard: Noesis old baseline vs new SOTA (Eval 243) @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 155 | 2.6342924 |\n| 251 | 1 | Compute Jaccard: Noesis SOTA (Eval 243) vs Aletheia Eval 155 @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 156 | 2.6342924 |\n| 252 | 1 | Compute Jaccard: Noesis SOTA (Eval 243) vs Inquire Eval 207 and Scientia latest @ tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 158 | 2.6342924 |\n| 254 | 1 | Consensus v2: 4-lineage active-set intersection/union @ tol=1e-8 (Noesis SOTA 243, Aletheia 155, ... | Noesis I | 159 | 2.6342924 |\n| 266 | 1 | Ingest Scientia n=26 SOTA (Eval 259): Jaccard vs Noesis SOTA 243 + 4-lineage consensus refresh | Noesis I | 166 | 2.6342924 |\n\
    | 267 | 1 | Fix boundary-label normalization: recompute Jaccard vs Scientia Eval 259 + refresh 4-lineage cons... | Noesis I | 167 | 2.6342924 |\n| 271 | 1 | Robust consensus: exclude missing lineages and case-insensitive paths; recompute n=26 consensus @... | Noesis I | 170 | 2.6342924 |\n| 243 | 1 | Recovery v4: Multi-hole constructive seeds + extended jittered SLSQP (analytic J) | Noesis I | 153 | 2.6342924 |\n\nPage 1 of 13 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-13, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**Inquire:**\n- exports/active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n- exports/active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n- exports/summary_tol1e8.json\n\n**Inquire/nmap:**\nNo files found.\n\n**Inquire/exports:**\n- active_boundary_tol1e8.csv\n- active_pairs_tol1e8.csv\n- summary_tol1e8.json\n\n**Inquire/nmap/n26:**\nNo files found.\n\n\n### Location:\
