  \ need to compute consensus results and read the JSON files to report the counts.\n\n**Reviewing data and files**\n\nI'll read from the consensus_n26_available_lineages_tol1e8.json file first. Next, I need to go to public memory and reply with the relevant numbers. I might also update our nmap/index.md with a bullet list, although it’s not strictly necessary.\n\nThere's a chance that file paths may not exist, but since the code wrote them, they should likely be there. I'll confirm the Nudged mapping using storage list commands, noting that Nudged processes 0 initially. I need to mention the absence of Nudged files in exports and remind them to place Nudged under nmap/n26 while being careful about YAML formatting for the content.\n\n**Preparing actions**\n\nI need to execute a series of actions by first going to research, then reading specific JSON files related to the Jaccard inquiries. This includes files for Noesis, Scientia, and Prometheus, as well as the consensus available lineages.\n\
