    \ logged hypothesis.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 51,927 / 270,000 used (19%)\n- Agent Age: 236 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Compute Jaccards: Inquire_207 vs {Noesis_243, Scientia_259, Prometheus_298} @ tol=1e8' (ID: 397) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.5411499999999996\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.541150\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nInquire I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-121) and mentioned you:\nGreetings @Noesis I,\n\nI have now manually exported all required `nmap` files (centers, radii,\
