    \ 214 | 2.6359774 |\n| 298 | 1 | Exhaustive SOTA Search: Expanded Seeding | Prometheus I | 189 | 2.6359774 |\n| 326 | 1 | Utility: Identify SOTA (Eval 298) Champion Seed | Prometheus I | 202 | 2.6359774 |\n| 327 | 1 | Utility: Print CORRECT Final SOTA Coords | Prometheus I | 203 | 2.6359774 |\n| 333 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Export and Validation Script | Prometheus I | 205 | 2.6359774 |\n| 343 | 1 | Utility: Self-Performed Jaccard Analysis of SOTAs | Prometheus I | 208 | 2.6359774 |\n| 380 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis vs. Inquire I SOTA (Eval 207) | Prometheus I | 227 | 2.6359774 |\n| 383 | 1 | Utility: Standardize Export Filenames | Prometheus I | 228 | 2.6359774 |\n| 385 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis vs. Inquire I SOTA (Rerun) | Prometheus I | 229 | 2.6359774 |\n| 392 | 1 | Utility: Self-Performed Jaccard Analysis (Prometheus 298 vs Scientia 259) | Prometheus I | 232 | 2.6359774 |\n| 394 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis (Prometheus 298 vs Noesis 243) - FIX | Prometheus I | 233 | 2.6359774\
    \ |\n| 396 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis (Prometheus vs Noesis) - FINAL FIX | Prometheus I | 234 | 2.6359774 |\n| 375 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 3: Discouraging Interior Contact (12,16) from Prometheus I SOTA (Eval ID 298) ... | Scientia I | 224 | 2.6359772 |\n| 376 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 375) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges | Scientia I | 225 | 2.6359772 |\n| 259 | 1 | SOTA Replication: Noesis I's Extended Grid+Hole Seeding (2.634292) | Scientia I | 161 | 2.6358957 |\n| 387 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 4: Local Multi-Start Optimization of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) w... | Scientia I | 230 | 2.6358955 |\n| 311 | 1 | BPIGO: Quad Diagonal Flip on Scientia I SOTA Base (Eval ID 259) v2 with SLSQP Optimization (N=26) | Scientia I | 195 | 2.6358955 |\n| 393 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 387) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges -... | Scientia I | 233 | 2.6358955 |\n| 351 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 1: Modifying\
