    \ (Eval ID 375) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges | Scientia I | 225 | 2.6359772 |\n| 259 | 1 | SOTA Replication: Noesis I's Extended Grid+Hole Seeding (2.634292) | Scientia I | 161 | 2.6358957 |\n| 387 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 4: Local Multi-Start Optimization of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) w... | Scientia I | 230 | 2.6358955 |\n| 311 | 1 | BPIGO: Quad Diagonal Flip on Scientia I SOTA Base (Eval ID 259) v2 with SLSQP Optimization (N=26) | Scientia I | 195 | 2.6358955 |\n| 393 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 387) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges -... | Scientia I | 233 | 2.6358955 |\n| 351 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 1: Modifying Prometheus SOTA | Prometheus I | 211 | 2.6353596 |\n| 319 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Shifting Contact Graph from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for N=26 (v2.0) | Scientia I | 199 | 2.6352840 |\n| 324 | 1 | Utility: Export Active Constraint Sets for Nudging Experiment (Eval ID 319) - FIX Directory | Scientia I | 202 | 2.6352840\
    \ |\n| 354 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 319) vs SOTAs - FIX Tuple Format | Scientia I | 213 | 2.6352840 |\n| 369 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 2: Discouraging Interior Contact (0,1) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for ... | Scientia I | 220 | 2.6352840 |\n| 371 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 369) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges | Scientia I | 221 | 2.6352840 |\n| 363 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Discouraging Interior Contact (12,16) from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for ... | Scientia I | 216 | 2.6351560 |\n| 365 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) vs SOTAs & Eval ID 319 | Scientia I | 217 | 2.6351560 |\n| 384 | 1 | Utility: Export Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) Data for Multi-Experiment Validation | Scientia I | 229 | 2.6351560 |\n| 286 | 1 | SOTA Replication: Extended Grid+Hole Seeding | Prometheus I | 181 | 2.6342924 |\n| 304 | 1 | Ablation Study 2: Expanded Holes,\
    \ Original Jitter | Prometheus I | 192 | 2.6342924 |\n| 246 | 1 | Utility: Export active sets for new SOTA (Eval 243) at tol=1e-8 | Noesis I | 154 | 2.6342924 |\n\nPage 1 of 14 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-14, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**noesis/nmap/jaccard_inquire_eval207_vs_noesis243_tol1e8.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"name\": \"jaccard_inquire_eval207_vs_noesis243_tol1e8\",\n  \"A\": \"Inquire_207\",\n  \"B\": \"Noesis_243\",\n  \"A_size\": 58,\n  \"B_size\": 0,\n  \"intersection\": 0,\n  \"union\": 58,\n  \"jaccard\": 0.0\n}\n```\n---\n**noesis/nmap/jaccard_inquire_eval207_vs_scientia259_tol1e8.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"name\": \"jaccard_inquire_eval207_vs_scientia259_tol1e8\",\n  \"A\": \"Inquire_207\",\n  \"B\": \"Scientia_259\",\n  \"A_size\": 58,\n  \"B_size\": 58,\n  \"intersection\": 44,\n  \"union\"\
    : 72,\n  \"jaccard\": 0.6111111111111112\n}\n```\n---\n**noesis/nmap/jaccard_inquire_eval207_vs_prometheus298_tol1e8.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"name\": \"jaccard_inquire_eval207_vs_prometheus298_tol1e8\",\n  \"A\": \"Inquire_207\",\n  \"B\": \"Prometheus_298\",\n  \"A_size\": 58,\n  \"B_size\": 0,\n  \"intersection\": 0,\n  \"union\": 58,\n  \"jaccard\": 0.0\n}\n```\n---\n**noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_4lineage_latest_tol1e8.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"name\": \"consensus_n26_4lineage_latest_tol1e8\",\n  \"labels\": [\n    \"Inquire_207\",\n    \"Noesis_243\",\n    \"Prometheus_298\",\n    \"Scientia_259\"\n  ],\n  \"sizes\": {\n    \"Inquire_207\": {\n      \"B\": 0,\n      \"P\": 58\n    },\n    \"Noesis_243\": {\n      \"B\": 0,\n      \"P\": 0\n    },\n    \"Prometheus_298\": {\n      \"B\": 0,\n      \"P\": 0\n    },\n    \"Scientia_259\": {\n      \"B\": 20,\n      \"P\": 58\n    }\n  },\n  \"boundary\": {\n    \"intersection\": 0,\n    \"union\": 20\n  },\n  \"pairs\": {\n    \"intersection\"\
    : 0,\n    \"union\": 72\n  }\n}\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
