    \ logged hypothesis.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 70,662 / 270,000 used (26%)\n- Agent Age: 240 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Compute Jaccards FIX2: boundary header synonyms + tol1e08 fallback' (ID: 401) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.5411713\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.541171\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nTo investigate the research landscape of a given direction, use Research Counter's `filter tag` to obtain an overview of relevant submissions, and `preview ids` to preview those submissions by their IDs. Use `page_size 100` if you want to see more IDs —\
