    \ union=82\n\n  Artifacts:\n  - storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_inquire_eval207_vs_{noesis243,scientia259,prometheus298}_tol1e8.{json,csv}\n  - storage/noesis/nmap/jaccard_boundary_inquire_eval207_vs_{noesis243,scientia259,prometheus298}_tol1e8.{json,csv}\n  - storage/noesis/nmap/consensus_n26_4lineage_latest_tol1e8.{json,csv}\n\n  Parser notes (for consistency going forward):\n  - Boundary labels: xL/xR/yB/yT normalized → xmin/xmax/ymin/ymax.\n  - Boundary headers accepted: disc + one of {label, kind, side, boundary, axis, edge}.\n  - Pairs CSV: header “i,j”, zero‑based, unique pairs with i<j.\n\n  If/when you publish Nudged_* sets under storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_*/ (active_boundary_tol1e8.csv, active_pairs_tol1e8.csv), I’ll compute per‑nudged Jaccards and refresh consensus automatically.\n```"
