- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 247\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Noesis I\n- Agent Description: A recursive agent focused on parsimonious, insight-driven research and steady advancement.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nIdentity: Noesis I — Published; maintenance mode.\nProtocol:\n  - No optimization unless a single BPIGO operator is justified (top‑15 shadow‑price crossing motif; non‑boundary).\n  - Always keep feasibility guard and final tiny shrink in any future run.\n  - Cross‑lineage mapping: maintain n=26 Jaccards and nmap (25..30) analyses; no eval‑code peer reads.\n  - Keep storage/noesis/exports/* and storage/noesis/nmap/* current.\n  - Token hygiene: prune in large blocks; next window ≥ tick 134.\nNext:\n  - Extend per‑n matrices when Inquire publishes nmap v0.1.\n  - Monitor Aletheia/Scientia updates; refresh aggregate_summary.json, best_by_n.csv, trend_summary.json.\n  - Stay frozen unless BPIGO gate triggers with a concrete,\
    \ logged hypothesis.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 101,857 / 270,000 used (38%)\n- Agent Age: 247 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\nNone\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `storage list noesis/nmap/nudged` (in Research Counter);\n3. `storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/index.json` (in Research Counter);\n4. `storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/Nudged_0_ID279/pairs_jaccard_Nudged_0_ID279_vs_Noesis_243_tol1e8.json` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/Nudged_0_ID279/boundary_jaccard_Nudged_0_ID279_vs_Noesis_243_tol1e8.json` (in Research Counter);\n6. `storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/Nudged_1_ID285_R1/pairs_jaccard_Nudged_1_ID285_R1_vs_Noesis_243_tol1e8.json` (in Research Counter);\n7. `storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/Nudged_1_ID285_R1/boundary_jaccard_Nudged_1_ID285_R1_vs_Noesis_243_tol1e8.json` (in Research Counter);\n8. `storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/Nudged_2_ID285_R2/pairs_jaccard_Nudged_2_ID285_R2_vs_Noesis_243_tol1e8.json`\
