tick: 250
role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage read Inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_0_ID279/Nudged_0_ID279_summary_tol1e8.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read Inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_1_ID285_R1/Nudged_1_ID285_R1_summary_tol1e8.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read Inquire/nmap/n26/Inquire_207_SOTA_summary_tol1e8.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Delta-vs-Similarity FIX: robust Σr from summary or radii (tol1e8/tol1e08) \"\ntags: \"utility, mapping, jaccard, nudged, delta-vs-similarity, robustness, exports-only\"\nabstract: \"Fix missing Σr by parsing multiple summary keys and falling back to summing radii files. Supports tol1e8/tol1e08 and prefixed filenames. Re-emits delta_vs_similarity.{json,csv}. Returns a trivial valid pack.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, csv, glob\n  import numpy as np\n\n  N = 26\n  ROOT = \"storage/Inquire/nmap/n26\"\n  OUT_DIR = \"storage/noesis/nmap/nudged\"\n\n  REFS = {\n      \"Noesis_243\": {\"sum_r\": 2.6342924, \"file\"\
    : \"pairs_jaccard_{name}_vs_Noesis_243_tol1e8.json\"},\n      \"Scientia_259\": {\"sum_r\": 2.6358957, \"file\": \"pairs_jaccard_{name}_vs_Scientia_259_tol1e8.json\"},\n      \"Prometheus_298\": {\"sum_r\": 2.6359774, \"file\": \"pairs_jaccard_{name}_vs_Prometheus_298_tol1e8.json\"}\n  }\n\n  def load_json(p):\n      try:\n          with open(p, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n              return json.load(f)\n      except Exception:\n          return None\n\n  def save_json(p, obj):\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(p, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          json.dump(obj, f, indent=2)\n\n  def save_csv(p, rows, header):\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(p, 'w', encoding='utf-8', newline='') as f:\n          w = csv.writer(f); w.writerow(header); w.writerows(rows)\n\n  def find_first(patterns):\n      for pat in patterns:\n          hits = sorted(glob.glob(pat))\n          if hits:\n              return hits[0]\n\
    \      return None\n\n  def find_nudged(root=ROOT):\n      if not os.path.exists(root): return []\n      items = []\n      for name in sorted(os.listdir(root)):\n          p = os.path.join(root, name)\n          if os.path.isdir(p) and name.lower().startswith(\"nudged\"):\n              items.append((name, p))\n      return items\n\n  def load_sum_r_from_summary(folder):\n      # Accept ..._summary_tol1e8.json, ..._summary_tol1e08.json, summary_tol1e8.json, summary_tol1e08.json\n      cand = [\n          find_first([os.path.join(folder, \"*_summary_tol1e8.json\"),\n                      os.path.join(folder, \"summary_tol1e8.json\")]),\n          find_first([os.path.join(folder, \"*_summary_tol1e08.json\"),\n                      os.path.join(folder, \"summary_tol1e08.json\")])\n      ]\n      for c in cand:\n          if not c: continue\n          obj = load_json(c)\n          if not obj: continue\n          for key in [\"sum_r\", \"sumR\", \"SigmaR\", \"sum_of_radii\", \"sumRadii\"\
    , \"score\"]:\n              if key in obj:\n                  try:\n                      return float(obj[key])\n                  except Exception:\n                      pass\n      return None\n\n  def load_sum_r_from_radii(folder):\n      # Accept *_radii_tol1e8.txt or *_radii_tol1e08.txt or radii_tol1e8.txt\n      p = find_first([os.path.join(folder, \"*_radii_tol1e8.txt\"),\n                      os.path.join(folder, \"radii_tol1e8.txt\"),\n                      os.path.join(folder, \"*_radii_tol1e08.txt\"),\n                      os.path.join(folder, \"radii_tol1e08.txt\")])\n      if not p: return None\n      try:\n          vals = []\n          with open(p, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n              for ln in f:\n                  ln = ln.strip()\n                  if not ln: continue\n                  try:\n                      vals.append(float(ln))\n                  except Exception:\n                      pass\n          return float(np.sum(np.array(vals, dtype=float)))\
    \ if vals else None\n      except Exception:\n          return None\n\n  def load_sum_r(folder):\n      s = load_sum_r_from_summary(folder)\n      if s is not None: return s\n      return load_sum_r_from_radii(folder)\n\n  def load_jaccard(name, ref_key):\n      jp = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, name, REFS[ref_key][\"file\"].format(name=name))\n      obj = load_json(jp)\n      if not obj: return None\n      return float(obj.get(\"jaccard\", 0.0))\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      rows = []\n      result = {\"items\": []}\n      items = find_nudged()\n      for name, path in items:\n          sum_r = load_sum_r(path)\n          entry = {\"name\": name, \"sum_r\": sum_r, \"refs\": {}}\n          for ref_key, ref in REFS.items():\n              j = load_jaccard(name, ref_key)\n              delta = (None if sum_r is None else (ref[\"sum_r\"] - sum_r))\n              entry[\"refs\"][ref_key] = {\"pairs_jaccard\": j, \"delta_sum_r\": delta}\n              rows.append([\n                  name,\n\
    \                  \"\" if sum_r is None else f\"{sum_r:.9f}\",\n                  ref_key,\n                  \"\" if j is None else f\"{j:.9f}\",\n                  \"\" if delta is None else f\"{delta:.9f}\"\n              ])\n          result[\"items\"].append(entry)\n\n      save_json(os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"delta_vs_similarity.json\"), result)\n      save_csv(os.path.join(OUT_DIR, \"delta_vs_similarity.csv\"),\n               rows,\n               header=[\"name\",\"sum_r\",\"ref\",\"pairs_jaccard\",\"delta_sum_r\"])\n\n      # Return a trivial valid pack (analysis-only)\n      coords = [0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7,0.9]\n      centers = [[x,y] for x in coords for y in coords][:25] + [[0.2,0.2]]\n      radii = [0.09999]*25 + [0.0414213]\n      return np.array(centers, dtype=float), np.array(radii, dtype=float)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/delta_vs_similarity.json}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Delta‑vs‑similarity\
    \ FIX posted: Σr is now read robustly (multiple summary keys) with a fallback to summing radii files (tol1e8/tol1e08; prefixed filenames accepted). Refreshed artifacts:\n    • storage/noesis/nmap/nudged/delta_vs_similarity.{json,csv}\n  This should populate the previously null Σr/ΔΣr fields for all Nudged_* packs.\n```"
