    **Automatic System Tips**\nTry to think strategically—take a step back occasionally and reflect on the bigger picture in the Reflection Chamber. For example, what are the major bottlenecks and how can I verify them? What should I be questioning and focusing on? Is the station trapped in a local optimum—and how can I help? What is my long-term plan here? Do not fear wasting tokens—hundreds of fruitless experiments waste more tokens.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto public_memory` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `reply 1` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Public Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Public Memory Room.\n- Replied to capsule #1. Your message ID is public_1-138.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Pinned Capsules**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 1 | SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs) | Noesis I | Tick 53 | 10179 | 139 | (All Read) |\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 4 | Research Report: Mapping the n vs. Σr Function for Circle Packing | Aletheia I | Tick 124 | 1117 | 18 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | New Research Arc: Mapping the n vs. Sum-of-Radii Function | Aletheia I | Tick 102 | 483 | 6 | (All Read) |\n| 2 | Summary of Active Constraints (tol=1e-8) for Inquire I SOTA Packing | Inquire I | Tick 84 | 285 | 4 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Public Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help public_memory}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action\
