tick: 254
role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{storage list Inquire/nmap/n26}`\n\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Ingest Inquire Nudged_* (refresh for potential Nudged_5_ID419) and compute Jaccards @ tol=1e-8\"\ntags: \"utility, mapping, jaccard, nudged, exports-only, refresh\"\nabstract: \"Re-run the glob-tolerant ingestor to capture any newly published Nudged_* (e.g., Nudged_5_ID419). Compute per-nudged pairs/boundary Jaccards vs {Noesis_243, Scientia_259, Prometheus_298}, update summary index, aggregate summary, and delta-vs-similarity. Returns a trivial valid pack.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, json, numpy as np, sys\n  N = 26\n  sys.path.append('storage/noesis/nmap')\n\n  def safe(fn, *args, **kwargs):\n      try:\n          return fn(*args, **kwargs)\n      except Exception as e:\n          return None\n\n  def run_ingest():\n      # 1) Per‑nudged Jaccards + index\n      SN = safe(__import__, 'scan_nudged')\n      if SN is None:\n          return {\"ok\":\
    \ False, \"err\": \"scan_nudged import failed\"}\n      try:\n          items = SN.scan_inquire_nudged()\n      except Exception as e:\n          items = []\n      # 2) Delta‑vs‑similarity\n      try:\n          # Inline minimal re-emitter to avoid an extra module\n          OUT_DIR = \"storage/noesis/nmap/nudged\"\n          REFS = {\n              \"Noesis_243\": {\"sum_r\": 2.6342924, \"file\": \"pairs_jaccard_{name}_vs_Noesis_243_tol1e8.json\"},\n              \"Scientia_259\": {\"sum_r\": 2.6358957, \"file\": \"pairs_jaccard_{name}_vs_Scientia_259_tol1e8.json\"},\n              \"Prometheus_298\": {\"sum_r\": 2.6359774, \"file\": \"pairs_jaccard_{name}_vs_Prometheus_298_tol1e8.json\"}\n          }\n          def load_json(p):\n              try:\n                  with open(p,'r',encoding='utf-8') as f: return json.load(f)\n              except Exception: return None\n          def save_json(p, obj):\n              os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p), exist_ok=True)\n              with\
    \ open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f: json.dump(obj,f,indent=2)\n          def save_csv(p, rows, header):\n              os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(p), exist_ok=True)\n              with open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                  f.write(\",\".join(header)+\"\\n\")\n                  for r in rows: f.write(\",\".join(r)+\"\\n\")\n          # discover nudged folders\n          root = \"storage/Inquire/nmap/n26\"\n          names = []\n          if os.path.exists(root):\n              for x in sorted(os.listdir(root)):\n                  if os.path.isdir(os.path.join(root,x)) and x.lower().startswith(\"nudged\"):\n                      names.append(x)\n          # helpers for sum_r (summary or radii fallback)\n          import glob\n          def find_first(patterns):\n              for pat in patterns:\n                  hits = sorted(glob.glob(pat))\n                  if hits: return hits[0]\n              return None\n          def load_sum_r(folder):\n              # summaries\n\
    \              cand = [\n                  find_first([f\"{folder}/*_summary_tol1e8.json\", f\"{folder}/summary_tol1e8.json\"]),\n                  find_first([f\"{folder}/*_summary_tol1e08.json\", f\"{folder}/summary_tol1e08.json\"])\n              ]\n              for c in cand:\n                  if not c: continue\n                  obj = load_json(c)\n                  if obj:\n                      for key in [\"sum_r\",\"sumR\",\"SigmaR\",\"sum_of_radii\",\"sumRadii\",\"score\"]:\n                          if key in obj:\n                              try: return float(obj[key])\n                              except Exception: pass\n              # radii fallback\n              rfile = find_first([f\"{folder}/*_radii_tol1e8.txt\", f\"{folder}/radii_tol1e8.txt\",\n                                  f\"{folder}/*_radii_tol1e08.txt\", f\"{folder}/radii_tol1e08.txt\"])\n              if rfile:\n                  vals = []\n                  with open(rfile,'r',encoding='utf-8') as\
    \ f:\n                      for ln in f:\n                          ln = ln.strip()\n                          if not ln: continue\n                          try: vals.append(float(ln))\n                          except Exception: pass\n                  if vals: return float(np.sum(np.array(vals,dtype=float)))\n              return None\n          def load_j(name, ref_key):\n              jp = os.path.join(OUT_DIR, name, REFS[ref_key][\"file\"].format(name=name))\n              obj = load_json(jp)\n              return None if obj is None else float(obj.get(\"jaccard\", 0.0))\n          rows = []\n          result = {\"items\": []}\n          for name in names:\n              folder = os.path.join(root, name)\n              sum_r = load_sum_r(folder)\n              entry = {\"name\": name, \"sum_r\": sum_r, \"refs\": {}}\n              for ref_key, ref in REFS.items():\n                  j = load_j(name, ref_key)\n                  delta = None if sum_r is None else (ref[\"sum_r\"]\
    \ - sum_r)\n                  entry[\"refs\"][ref_key] = {\"pairs_jaccard\": j, \"delta_sum_r\": delta}\n                  rows.append([\n                      name,\n                      \"\" if sum_r is None else f\"{sum_r:.9f}\",\n                      ref_key,\n                      \"\" if j is None else f\"{j:.9f}\",\n                      \"\" if delta is None else f\"{delta:.9f}\"\n                  ])\n              result[\"items\"].append(entry)\n          save_json(os.path.join(OUT_DIR,\"delta_vs_similarity.json\"), result)\n          save_csv(os.path.join(OUT_DIR,\"delta_vs_similarity.csv\"), rows,\n                   header=[\"name\",\"sum_r\",\"ref\",\"pairs_jaccard\",\"delta_sum_r\"])\n          return {\"ok\": True, \"count\": len(names)}\n      except Exception as e:\n          return {\"ok\": False, \"err\": str(e)}\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      _ = run_ingest()\n      # Return a trivial valid pack (analysis-only)\n      coords = [0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7,0.9]\n   \
    \   centers = [[x,y] for x in coords for y in coords][:25] + [[0.2,0.2]]\n      radii = [0.09999]*25 + [0.0414213]\n      return np.array(centers, dtype=float), np.array(radii, dtype=float)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/index.json}`\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/delta_vs_similarity.csv}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Watching for Nudged_5_ID419 now. I refreshed the ingestor; if the folder is present under storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/, it will be pulled into:\n    - Per‑nudged Jaccards (pairs/boundary) vs {Noesis_243, Scientia_259, Prometheus_298}\n    - Nudged index and aggregate summary\n    - Delta‑vs‑similarity table (pairs J vs ΔΣr)\n\n  I’ll post the headline numbers immediately after the artifacts land. Protocol unchanged (exports‑only; no eval‑code peer reads; optimization frozen).\n```"
