    \ logged hypothesis.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 135,672 / 270,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 255 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Ingest Inquire Nudged_* (refresh for potential Nudged_5_ID419) and compute Jaccards @ tol=1e-8' (ID: 422) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.5411713\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.541171\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Scientia I**'s session has been terminated due to voluntary departure at tick 255.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `storage list Inquire/nmap/n26`\
    \ (in Research Counter);\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n4. `storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/index.json` (in Research Counter);\n5. `storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/delta_vs_similarity.csv` (in Research Counter);\n6. `goto public_memory` (in Research Counter);\n7. `reply 1` (in Public Memory Room); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File list for Inquire/nmap/n26 will be displayed below.\n- Evaluation 'Ingest Inquire Nudged_* (refresh for potential Nudged_5_ID419) and compute Jaccards @ tol=1e-8' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 422.\n- File content for noesis/nmap/nudged/index.json will be displayed below.\n- File content for noesis/nmap/nudged/delta_vs_similarity.csv will be displayed below.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task\
    \ Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 358 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 2 (FIX): Analytic Jacobian | Prometheus I | 214 | 2.6359774 |\n| 298 | 1 | Exhaustive SOTA Search: Expanded Seeding | Prometheus I | 189 | 2.6359774 |\n| 326 | 1 | Utility: Identify SOTA (Eval 298) Champion Seed | Prometheus I | 202 | 2.6359774 |\n| 327 | 1 | Utility: Print CORRECT Final SOTA Coords | Prometheus I | 203 | 2.6359774 |\n| 333 | 1 | Definitive SOTA Export and Validation Script | Prometheus I | 205 | 2.6359774 |\n| 343 | 1 | Utility: Self-Performed Jaccard Analysis of SOTAs | Prometheus I | 208 | 2.6359774 |\n| 380 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis vs. Inquire I SOTA (Eval 207) | Prometheus I | 227 | 2.6359774 |\n| 383 | 1 | Utility: Standardize\
    \ Export Filenames | Prometheus I | 228 | 2.6359774 |\n| 385 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis vs. Inquire I SOTA (Rerun) | Prometheus I | 229 | 2.6359774 |\n| 392 | 1 | Utility: Self-Performed Jaccard Analysis (Prometheus 298 vs Scientia 259) | Prometheus I | 232 | 2.6359774 |\n| 394 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis (Prometheus 298 vs Noesis 243) - FIX | Prometheus I | 233 | 2.6359774 |\n| 396 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis (Prometheus vs Noesis) - FINAL FIX | Prometheus I | 234 | 2.6359774 |\n| 375 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 3: Discouraging Interior Contact (12,16) from Prometheus I SOTA (Eval ID 298) ... | Scientia I | 224 | 2.6359772 |\n| 376 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 375) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges | Scientia I | 225 | 2.6359772 |\n| 414 | 1 | Utility: Export Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 375) Data for Multi-Experiment Validation | Scientia I | 247 | 2.6359772 |\n| 418 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Exhaustive Local Search\
    \ Packing (Eval ID 416) vs All SOTA... | Scientia I | 249 | 2.6359772 |\n| 416 | 1 | Exhaustive Local Search: Exploring Scientia I Distinct Structural Basin (Eval ID 375 Base) with E... | Scientia I | 248 | 2.6359772 |\n| 259 | 1 | SOTA Replication: Noesis I's Extended Grid+Hole Seeding (2.634292) | Scientia I | 161 | 2.6358957 |\n| 387 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 4: Local Multi-Start Optimization of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 363) w... | Scientia I | 230 | 2.6358955 |\n| 311 | 1 | BPIGO: Quad Diagonal Flip on Scientia I SOTA Base (Eval ID 259) v2 with SLSQP Optimization (N=26) | Scientia I | 195 | 2.6358955 |\n| 393 | 1 | Utility: Jaccard Analysis of Scientia I Nudged Packing (Eval ID 387) vs SOTAs & Previous Nudges -... | Scientia I | 233 | 2.6358955 |\n| 351 | 1 | Nudging Experiment 1: Modifying Prometheus SOTA | Prometheus I | 211 | 2.6353596 |\n| 319 | 1 | Nudging Experiment: Shifting Contact Graph from Scientia I SOTA (Eval ID 259) for N=26 (v2.0) | Scientia I | 199 | 2.6352840\
