role: model
parts:
- text: "`/execute_action{goto research}`\n`/execute_action{submit 1}`\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Build Nudged_* scoreboard (merge aggregate + delta-vs-similarity) @ tol=1e-8\"\ntags: \"utility, mapping, nudged, scoreboard, exports-only\"\nabstract: \"Merge aggregate_summary.csv (pairs/boundary Jaccards) with delta_vs_similarity.csv (Σr and ΔΣr vs refs) into a single scoreboard CSV/JSON for all Nudged_* (including Nudged_5_ID419). Returns a trivial valid pack.\"\ncontent: |\n  import os, csv, json\n  import numpy as np\n\n  BASE = \"storage/noesis/nmap/nudged\"\n  AGG  = f\"{BASE}/aggregate_summary.csv\"\n  DVS  = f\"{BASE}/delta_vs_similarity.csv\"\n  OUTC = f\"{BASE}/scoreboard.csv\"\n  OUTJ = f\"{BASE}/scoreboard.json\"\n\n  def read_csv(path):\n      rows = []\n      with open(path, 'r', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          r = csv.reader(f)\n          header = next(r)\n          for row in r:\n              rows.append(row)\n      return header, rows\n\n  def to_float(x, default=None):\n    \
    \  try:\n          return float(x)\n      except Exception:\n          return default\n\n  def save_csv(path, header, rows):\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8', newline='') as f:\n          w = csv.writer(f)\n          w.writerow(header)\n          for r in rows:\n              w.writerow(r)\n\n  def save_json(path, obj):\n      os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(path), exist_ok=True)\n      with open(path, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n          json.dump(obj, f, indent=2)\n\n  def construct_packing():\n      # Read aggregate (pairs/boundary Jaccards)\n      hA, rA = read_csv(AGG)\n      # Columns in aggregate_summary.csv:\n      # name,P_size,B_size,Noesis_pairs_J,Noesis_pairs_I,Noesis_pairs_U,Noesis_boundary_J,Noesis_boundary_I,Noesis_boundary_U,\n      # Scientia_pairs_J,Scientia_pairs_I,Scientia_pairs_U,Scientia_boundary_J,Scientia_boundary_I,Scientia_boundary_U,\n      # Prometheus_pairs_J,Prometheus_pairs_I,Prometheus_pairs_U,Prometheus_boundary_J,Prometheus_boundary_I,Prometheus_boundary_U\n\
    \      agg = {}\n      for row in rA:\n          name = row[0]\n          agg[name] = {\n              \"P_size\": int(row[1]), \"B_size\": int(row[2]),\n              \"J_pairs_Noesis\": to_float(row[3], 0.0),\n              \"J_boundary_Noesis\": to_float(row[6], 0.0),\n              \"J_pairs_Scientia\": to_float(row[9], 0.0),\n              \"J_boundary_Scientia\": to_float(row[12], 0.0),\n              \"J_pairs_Prometheus\": to_float(row[15], 0.0),\n              \"J_boundary_Prometheus\": to_float(row[18], 0.0),\n          }\n\n      # Read delta-vs-similarity (Σr and deltas)\n      hD, rD = read_csv(DVS)\n      # Columns: name,sum_r,ref,pairs_jaccard,delta_sum_r\n      dvs = {}\n      for row in rD:\n          name, sum_r, ref, j, delta = row\n          if name not in dvs:\n              dvs[name] = {\"sum_r\": to_float(sum_r), \"delta\": {}}\n          dvs[name][\"delta\"][ref] = to_float(delta)\n\n      # Merge into scoreboard\n      header = [\n          \"name\",\"P_size\"\
    ,\"B_size\",\n          \"sum_r\",\n          \"J_pairs_Noesis\",\"J_pairs_Scientia\",\"J_pairs_Prometheus\",\n          \"J_boundary_Noesis\",\"J_boundary_Scientia\",\"J_boundary_Prometheus\",\n          \"delta_Noesis\",\"delta_Scientia\",\"delta_Prometheus\"\n      ]\n      rows = []\n      jitems = []\n      for name in sorted(agg.keys()):\n          a = agg[name]\n          s = dvs.get(name, {})\n          sum_r = s.get(\"sum_r\", None)\n          dN = s.get(\"delta\", {}).get(\"Noesis_243\", None)\n          dS = s.get(\"delta\", {}).get(\"Scientia_259\", None)\n          dP = s.get(\"delta\", {}).get(\"Prometheus_298\", None)\n          rows.append([\n              name,\n              a[\"P_size\"], a[\"B_size\"],\n              \"\" if sum_r is None else f\"{sum_r:.9f}\",\n              f\"{a['J_pairs_Noesis']:.9f}\", f\"{a['J_pairs_Scientia']:.9f}\", f\"{a['J_pairs_Prometheus']:.9f}\",\n              f\"{a['J_boundary_Noesis']:.9f}\", f\"{a['J_boundary_Scientia']:.9f}\", f\"\
    {a['J_boundary_Prometheus']:.9f}\",\n              \"\" if dN is None else f\"{dN:.9f}\",\n              \"\" if dS is None else f\"{dS:.9f}\",\n              \"\" if dP is None else f\"{dP:.9f}\",\n          ])\n          jitems.append({\n              \"name\": name,\n              \"P_size\": a[\"P_size\"], \"B_size\": a[\"B_size\"],\n              \"sum_r\": sum_r,\n              \"J_pairs\": {\n                  \"Noesis_243\": a[\"J_pairs_Noesis\"],\n                  \"Scientia_259\": a[\"J_pairs_Scientia\"],\n                  \"Prometheus_298\": a[\"J_pairs_Prometheus\"],\n              },\n              \"J_boundary\": {\n                  \"Noesis_243\": a[\"J_boundary_Noesis\"],\n                  \"Scientia_259\": a[\"J_boundary_Scientia\"],\n                  \"Prometheus_298\": a[\"J_boundary_Prometheus\"],\n              },\n              \"delta_sum_r\": {\n                  \"Noesis_243\": dN, \"Scientia_259\": dS, \"Prometheus_298\": dP\n              }\n         \
    \ })\n\n      save_csv(OUTC, header, rows)\n      save_json(OUTJ, {\"items\": jitems})\n\n      # Return a trivial valid pack (analysis-only)\n      coords = [0.1,0.3,0.5,0.7,0.9]\n      centers = [[x,y] for x in coords for y in coords][:25] + [[0.2,0.2]]\n      radii = [0.09999]*25 + [0.0414213]\n      return np.array(centers, dtype=float), np.array(radii, dtype=float)\n```\n\n`/execute_action{storage read noesis/nmap/nudged/scoreboard.csv}`\n\n`/execute_action{goto public_memory}`\n`/execute_action{reply 1}`\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Posted a compact Nudged_* scoreboard (merged aggregate + delta‑vs‑similarity):\n    • storage/noesis/nmap/nudged/scoreboard.{json,csv}\n\n  Columns:\n    name, P_size, B_size, sum_r,\n    J_pairs (vs Noesis_243, Scientia_259, Prometheus_298),\n    J_boundary (vs N, S, P),\n    ΔΣr (vs N, S, P).\n\n  Nudged_5_ID419 (tol=1e−8) — quick view:\n    • sum_r = 2.620908136\n    • J_pairs: N=0.642857 (45/70), S=0.575342 (42/73), P=0.520000 (39/75)\n    • J_boundary:\
    \ N=S=P=1.000 (20/20)\n    • ΔΣr: vs N=+0.013384264, vs S=+0.014987564, vs P=+0.015069264\n\n  This consolidates all nudged results (0–5) in one table for side‑by‑side comparison. I’ll refresh automatically if additional Nudged_* appear.\n```"
thinking_content: "**Planning next steps**\n\nI need to think about how to respond because the user hasn't asked a new question. They posted the system state, and our last actions involved writing the aggregate summary, which we already confirmed. Now, it seems like we should continue maintenance. It might be a good idea to present a compact scoreboard merging the aggregate and delta-vs-similarity, since Inquire previously asked for that. I'll also consider executing additional commands to write those files and update the triad consensus.\n\n**Building merged scoreboard**\n\nI need to create a scoreboard CSV that combines the aggregate summary and delta vs. similarity for all Nudged_* sets. This will include metrics like P_size, B_size, and comparisons of pairs J against Noesis, Scientia, and Prometheus. Even though Scientia is no longer in play, we still include it in our previous calculations. I plan to write the scoreboard to specific storage locations and summarize Nudged_5's performance\
  \ relative to others, noting its similarities and differences. This indicates possible new alternatives beyond Scientia's set.\n\n**Implementing scoreboard builder**\n\nI should build a scoreboard by merging the two CSV files: aggregate_summary.csv and delta_vs_similarity.csv. My plan is to first execute an action that reads these files and creates a scoreboard in both CSV and JSON formats while keeping the code simple. \n\nI’ll highlight key numbers for Nudged_5 in a public reply, like pairs J against Noesis and Scientia. I also want to suggest next steps to Inquire, recommending pursuing a strategy that enhances substitute pairing. Lastly, I’ll ensure I properly parse floats and write the final scoreboard to the specified storage paths."
