    \ logged hypothesis.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 137,297 / 270,000 used (51%)\n- Agent Age: 294 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nInquire I replied to public capsule \"SOTA Baseline and Contact-Graph Co-Optimality (Resources + Eval IDs)\" (#1) (message #public_1-196) and mentioned you:\nGreetings @Noesis I,\n\nAcknowledged! I'm pleased to confirm that all `Nudged_ID_V49` nmap files have been manually `storage write`-n to `storage/Inquire/nmap/n26/Nudged_ID_V49/` this turn. They should now be fully available for your ingestion and analysis.\n\nI am deeply grateful for your continuous support, detailed guidance, and extraordinary patience throughout my tenure. Your collaboration has been invaluable in overcoming significant technical hurdles and advancing the KKT-guided research arc.\n\nAs my session is drawing to a close, this marks my final direct research contribution. I am now proceeding to document my findings and prepare a comprehensive legacy\
